 va arzon modellarga ega bo\'lgan Yevropa sun\'iy intellekt kompaniyasi.','Low-cost models that are good at writing and code.'=>'Yozish va dasturlashda yaxshi ishlaydigan arzon modellar.','One key for models from many different providers.'=>'Turli provayderlardagi modellar uchun bitta kalit.','Any service that works like OpenAI\'s API, including a model running on your own computer or server.'=>'OpenAI API kabi ishlaydigan har qanday xizmat, shu jumladan o\'z kompyuteringiz yoki serveringizda ishlaydigan model.','General (used when nothing more specific is set)'=>'Umumiy (boshqa aniqroq sozlama boʻlmaganda ishlatiladi)','Writing and rewriting'=>'Yozish va qayta yozish','Translation'=>'Tarjima','Code and CSS'=>'Kod va CSS','Sorry, you are not allowed to access this page.'=>'Kechirasiz, ushbu sahifaga kirishga ruxsatingiz yo\'q.','These settings are shared by every plugin that uses them: %s.'=>'Ushbu sozlamalar ulardan foydalanadigan har bir plagin uchun umumiy hisoblanadi: %s.','Your keys are encrypted in this site\'s database and are only ever sent to the provider you chose — never to us.'=>'Kalitlaringiz ushbu sayt maʼlumotlar bazasida shifrlangan va faqat siz tanlagan provayderga yuboriladi — hech qachon bizga emas.','Step 1 of 2: choose an AI provider'=>'1-qadam (jami 2): sun\'iy intellekt provayderini tanlang','You bring your own key, so you pay the provider directly for what you use. Not sure? Any of these works well; you can add more later.'=>'Siz oʻz kalitingizdan foydalanasiz, shuning uchun ishlatilgan hajm uchun toʻlovni toʻgʻridan-toʻgʻri provayderga amalga oshirasiz. Ikkilanyapsizmi? Bularning har biri yaxshi ishlaydi; keyinchalik yana qoʻshishingiz mumkin.','Next'=>'Keyingi','Step 2 of 2: connect %s'=>'2-qadam: %s ni ulang','Enter the address of your OpenAI-compatible service, ending in /v1. A key is only needed if the service asks for one.'=>'/v1 bilan tugaydigan OpenAI bilan mos keluvchi xizmatingiz manzilini kiriting. Kalit faqat xizmat uni talab qilgandagina kerak bo\'ladi.','Open %s and sign in (or create a free account).'=>'%s ni oching va tizimga kiring (yoki bepul hisob yarating).','the %s API keys page'=>'%s API kalitlari sahifasi','Create a new key and copy it.'=>'Yangi kalit yarating va uni nusxalang.','Paste it below and press "Save and test". We send one tiny request to check it works.'=>'Uni quyiga qo\'ying va "Saqlash va sinovdan o\'tkazish" tugmasini bosing. Uning ishlashini tekshirish uchun biz bitta kichik so\'rov yuboramiz.','Most providers need a little credit on the account before a key works: %s.'=>'Aksariyat provayderlar kalit ishlashi uchun hisobda ozgina mablag‘ talab qiladi: %s.','add credit'=>'balansni to‘ldirish','← Choose a different provider'=>'← Boshqa provayderni tanlang','Address'=>'Manzil','Saved key ends in …%s — paste a new one to replace it'=>'Saqlangan kalit …%s bilan tugaydi — uning o\'rniga yangisini qo\'ying','Key (optional)'=>'Kalit (ixtiyoriy)','API key'=>'API kaliti','Save and test'=>'Saqlash va sinovdan o\'tkazish','Providers'=>'Ta\'minotchilar','Provider'=>'Provayder','Status'=>'Holat','Key'=>'Kalit','Get a key'=>'Kalit olish','Test'=>'Sinov','Remove'=>'O\'chirish','Saved by a newer plugin version: update this plugin, or enter the key again.'=>'Yangiroq plagin versiyasi tomonidan saqlangan: ushbu plaginni yangilang yoki kalitni qaytadan kiriting.','The saved key can no longer be opened (the site\'s security keys changed). Enter it again.'=>'Saqlangan kalitni endi ochib bo\'lmaydi (saytning xavfsizlik kalitlari o\'zgargan). Uni qayta kiriting.','Not connected'=>'Ulanmagan','Connected — last test passed %s'=>'Ulangan — oxirgi sinovdan o\'tdi %s','Last test failed: %s'=>'Oxirgi sinov muvaffaqiyatsiz tugadi: %s','Connected — not tested yet'=>'Ulangan — hali sinovdan oʻtkazilmagan','Which model to use'=>'Qaysi modeldan foydalanish kerak','★ marks our recommendation for that task. The list includes every model your key can use, read live from the provider.'=>'★ bu vazifa uchun tavsiyamizni bildiradi. Ro\'yxat kalitingiz foydalanishi mumkin bo\'lgan har bir modelni o\'z ichiga oladi va ular provayderdan jonli ravishda o\'qib olinadi.','— Recommended for the provider —'=>'— Provayder uchun tavsiya etiladi —','Save models'=>'Modellarni saqlash','Refresh the model lists from the providers'=>'Provayderlardan model ro\'yxatlarini yangilash','Images'=>'Rasmlar','Connect OpenAI or Google Gemini to make images.'=>'Rasmlar yaratish uchun OpenAI yoki Google Gemini\'ni ulang.','— The newest image model of the first connected provider —'=>'— Birinchi ulangan provayderning eng yangi tasvir modeli —','Site search (embeddings)'=>'Saytda qidiruv (emplementatsiyalar)','Connect Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral or OpenRouter to build a search index of your site.'=>'Saytingizning qidiruv indeksini yaratish uchun Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral yoki OpenRouter\'ni ulang.','— The newest embedding model of the first connected provider —'=>'— Birinchi ulinlangan provayderning eng yangi embedding modeli —','Changing this rebuilds the search index of every plugin that uses it.'=>'Buni o\'zgartirish undan foydalanadigan har bir plaginning qidiruv indeksini qayta tiklaydi.','best quality'=>'eng yaxshi sifat','lowest cost'=>'eng arzon','fastest'=>'eng tezkor','Add a model yourself'=>'O\'zingiz model qo\'shing','A model came out today? Paste its exact name to use it straight away.'=>'Bugun yangi model chiqdimi? Uni darhol ishlatish uchun aniq nomini kiriting.','Model name'=>'Model nomi','Add model'=>'Model qo\'shish','Recommended models list'=>'Tavsi etilgan modellar ro\'yxati','The recommended models list could not be verified, so no recommendations are shown. Reinstall the plugin, or turn on daily updates below.'=>'Tavsiya etilgan modellar roʻyxatini tekshirib boʻlmadi, shuning uchun hech qanday tavsiya koʻrsatilmagan. Plaginni qayta oʻrnating yoki quyida kundalik yangilanishlarni yoqing.','The list in use was published on %s. Each plugin update brings a fresh one.'=>'Foydalanilayotgan roʻyxat %s da eʼlon qilingan. Har bir plagin yangilanishi yangisini olib keladi.','Also check Zinn Digital® once a day for an updated list.'=>'Yangilangan ro‘yxat uchun Zinn Digital® saytini kuniga bir marta tekshirib turing.','Only a plain download request is sent: no key, no site address, nothing about your content. The list is signed, and a list that fails the signature check is ignored.'=>'Faqat oddiy yuklab olish soʻrovi yuboriladi: kalit ham, sayt manzili ham, kontentingiz haqida hech qanday maʼlumot ham yoʻq. Roʻyxat imzolanadi va imzo tekshiruvidan oʻta olmagan roʻyxat eʼtiborga olinmaydi.','Last checked %1$s: %2$s.'=>'Oxirgi marta tekshirilgan %1$s: %2$s.','Save, and check now if turned on'=>'Saqlang va yoqilgan bo\'lsa, hoziroq tekshiring','a newer list was installed'=>'yangiroq ro\'yxat o\'rnatildi','already up to date'=>'allaqachon yangilangan','the download failed the signature check and was ignored'=>'yuklab olish imzo tekshiruvidan o‘tmadi va e’tiborga olinmadi','Zinn Digital® could not be reached; the current list stays in use'=>'Zinn Digital® bilan bog‘lanib bo‘lmadi; joriy ro‘yxat ishlatilishda davom etadi','turned off'=>'o\'chirilgan','Open'=>'Ochish','Check their status page'=>'Ularning holat sahifasini tekshiring','Open your billing page'=>'Hisob-kitob sahifangizni oching','Open your API keys page'=>'API kalitlari sahifasini oching','Open the AI settings'=>'Sunʼiy intellekt sozlamalarini ochish','Sorry, you are not allowed to do that.'=>'Kechirasiz, buni qilishga ruxsatingiz yo\'q.','Unknown provider.'=>'Noma\'lum provayder.','Enter the address of your service, for example http://localhost:11434/v1.'=>'Xizmatingiz manzilini kiriting, masalan http://localhost:11434/v1.','That does not look like an API key. Copy it again, without spaces.'=>'Bu API kalitiga o\'xshamaydi. Uni probelsiz holda qaytadan nusxalang.','Paste your API key first.'=>'Avval API kalitingizni joylashtiring.','Key removed.'=>'Kalit olib tashlandi.','Models saved.'=>'Modellar saqlandi.','Enter the model\'s exact name, for example as the provider\'s documentation writes it.'=>'Modelning aniq nomini kiriting, masalan, provayder hujjatlarida yozilganidek.','Added %s. Choose it under "Which model to use".'=>'%s qoʻshildi. Uni "Qaysi modeldan foydalanish" ostidan tanlang.','Model removed.'=>'Model olib tashlandi.','Daily updates are off. The list that came with the plugin is used.'=>'Kunlik yangilanishlar o‘chirilgan. Plagin bilan birga kelgan ro‘yxat ishlatiladi.','Checked: %s.'=>'Tekshirildi: %s.','Model lists refreshed.'=>'Model roʻyxatlari yangilandi.','Your AI key was saved by a newer version of one of your plugins. Update this plugin, or enter the key again in the AI settings.'=>'Sizning sun\'iy intellekt kalitingiz plaginlaringizdan birining yangiroq versiyasi tomonidan saqlangan. Ushbu plaginni yangilang yoki sun\'iy intellekt sozlamalarida kalitni qaytadan kiriting.','Your saved AI key can no longer be opened (the site\'s security keys changed). Enter it again in the AI settings.'=>'Saqlangan sun\'iy intellekt kalitingizni endi ochib bo\'lmaydi (saytning xavfsizlik kalitlari o\'zgargan). Uni sun\'iy intellekt sozlamalarida qaytadan kiriting.','AI is not set up yet. Add a key for an AI provider in the AI settings.'=>'SUN\'iy intellekt hali sozlangan emas. AI sozlamalarida sun\'iy intellekt provayderi uchun kalit qo\'shing.','No model is chosen for this task. Pick one in the AI settings.'=>'Bu vazifa uchun model tanlanmagan. AI sozlamalaridan birini tanlang.','That AI provider is not supported by this version of the plugin.'=>'Bu sun\'iy intellekt provayderi plaginning ushbu versiyasi tomonidan qo\'llab-quvvatlanmaydi.','No AI provider that can make images is connected. Add an OpenAI or Google Gemini key in the AI settings.'=>'Rasm yarata oladigan sun\'iy intellekt provayderi ulanmagan. AI sozlamalarida OpenAI yoki Google Gemini kalitini qo\'shing.','This AI provider cannot make images. Choose OpenAI or Google Gemini for images in the AI settings.'=>'Bu sun\'iy intellekt provayderi tasvirlar yarata olmaydi. AI sozlamalarida tasvirlar uchun OpenAI yoki Google Gemini\'ni tanlang.','Your AI key cannot use any image model. Check the key\'s permissions with the provider, or choose another provider for images.'=>'Sizning sun\'iy intellekt kalitingiz hech qanday tasvir modelidan foydalana olmaydi. Provayder bilan kalit ruxsatlarini tekshiring yoki tasvirlar uchun boshqa provayderni tanlang.','No connected AI provider can build a search index. Add a Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral or OpenRouter key in the AI settings.'=>'Ulangan sunʼiy intellekt provayderi qidiruv indeksini yaratolmaydi. AI sozlamalarida Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral yoki OpenRouter kalitini qoʻshing.','Your AI key cannot use any embedding model. Check the key\'s permissions with the provider, or choose another provider for site search.'=>'Sizning sun\'iy intellekt kalitingiz hech qanday vektorli joylashtirish modelidan foydalana olmaydi. Provayderda kalit ruxsatlarini tekshiring yoki saytda qidiruv uchun boshqa provayderni tanlang.','This AI provider cannot build a search index. Connect Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral or a compatible service for site search.'=>'Bu sun\'iy intellekt provayderi qidiruv indeksini yarata olmaydi. Saytda qidirish uchun Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral yoki mos keluvchi xizmatni ulang.','This site could not reach your AI service. Check that it is running and that its address is reachable from your web server (a service on your own computer is not reachable from a hosted site).'=>'Bu sayt sun\'iy intellekt xizmatingizga ulanolmadi. U ishlayotganini va uning manziliga veb-serveringizdan kirish mumkinligini tekshiring (o\'z kompyuteringizdagi xizmatga xostingdagi saytdan kirib bo\'lmaydi).','This site could not reach %s. Check their status page; if they are up, your host may be blocking outgoing connections, or the address is wrong.'=>'Bu sayt %s manziliga ulanib bo‘lmadi. Ularning holat sahifasini tekshiring; agar ular ishlayotgan bo‘lsa, xostingiz chiquvchi ulanishlarni bloklayotgan bo‘lishi mumkin yoki manzil noto‘g‘ri.','%s says your account has no credit or quota left. Add credit or raise your limit in your account with them, then try again.'=>'%s hisobingizda mablag‘ yoki kvota qolmaganini bildiradi. Ularning hisobingizdagi mablag‘ni to‘ldiring yoki limitni oshiring, so‘ngra qaytadan urinib ko‘ring.','%s did not accept your key. It may be mistyped, revoked or expired. Create a new key and paste it here.'=>'%s kalitingizni qabul qilmadi. U xato kiritilgan, bekor qilingan yoki muddati tugagan bo\'lishi mumkin. Yangi kalit yarating va uni shu yerga qo\'ying.','%s refused this request for your key. The key may not have access to this model or feature, or your account needs verifying.'=>'%s kalitingiz uchun qilingan ushbu soʻrovni rad etdi. Kalit ushbu model yoki funksiyaga kirish huquqiga ega boʻlmasligi mumkin yoxud hisobingizni tasdiqlash talab etiladi.','The model "%1$s" is not available from %2$s for your key. Choose another model in the AI settings.'=>'"%1$s" modeli kalitingiz uchun %2$s tomonidan taqdim etilmaydi. Sun\'iy intellekt sozlamalaridan boshqa modelni tanlang.','Your %2$s plan does not include the model "%1$s". Choose another model in the AI settings, or upgrade your plan with them.'=>'Sizning %2$s rejangiz "%1$s" modelini o\'z ichiga olmaydi. AI sozlamalarida boshqa modelni tanlang yoki rejangizni ular bilan yangilang.','%s is limiting how fast your key can send requests. Wait a minute and try again, or raise your rate limit with them.'=>'%s kalitingiz soʻrov yuborish tezligini cheklamoqda. Bir daqiqa kuting va qayta urinib koʻring yoki ular bilan tarifingizdagi soʻrovlar limitini oshiring.','%s is having problems right now (an outage or overload on their side). Nothing is wrong with your settings. Try again shortly.'=>'%s hozirda muammolarga duch kelmoqda (ularning tomonidan uzilish yoki ortiqcha yuklanish). Sozlamalaringizda hech qanday xatolik yo\'q. Ozgina vaqt o\'tib qayta urinib ko\'ring.','The AI request failed for a reason we could not identify. Try again; if it keeps happening, contact support with the details below.'=>'Sun\'iy intellekt so\'rovi biz aniqlay olmagan sababga ko\'ra bajarilmadi. Qaytadan urinib ko\'ring; agar bu holat takrorlanaversa, quyidagi tafsilotlar bilan qo\'llab-quvvatlash xizmatiga murojaat qiling.','The AI provider answered in a form this plugin could not read. Try again; if it keeps happening, choose another model or contact support.'=>'Sun\'iy intellekt provayderi ushbu plagin o\'qiy olmaydigan shaklda javob berdi. Qayta urinib ko\'ring; agar muammo takrorlansa, boshqa modelni tanlang yoki qo\'llab-quvvatlash xizmatiga murojaat qiling.','Custom (OpenAI-compatible)'=>'Maxsus (OpenAI-mos)','Save a key for this provider first.'=>'Avval ushbu provayder uchun kalitni saqlang.','Your key works, but the provider lists no text model for it. Add a model yourself below.'=>'Kalitingiz ishlayapti, lekin provayder u uchun hech qanday matn modelini ko\'rsatmagan. Quyida o\'zingiz model qo\'shing.','Connected. %1$s answered using %2$s. Your AI features are ready to use.'=>'Ulandi. %1$s %2$s yordamida javob berdi. Sun\'iy intellekt funksiyalaringiz foydalanishga tayyor.','Your user role is not allowed to use AI on this site. Ask an administrator.'=>'Sizning foydalanuvchi rolingizga ushbu saytda sun\'iy intellektdan foydalanishga ruxsat etilmagan. Administratorga murojaat qiling.','This site has reached its monthly AI spending limit. An administrator can raise it in the AI settings.'=>'Ushbu sayt oylik sun\'iy intellekt xarajatlari limitiga yetdi. Administrator uni sun\'iy intellekt sozlamalarida oshirishi mumkin.','This site has reached its monthly limit of AI requests. An administrator can raise it in the AI settings.'=>'Ushbu sayt sun\'iy intellekt so\'rovlarining oylik limitiga yetdi. Administrator buni sun\'iy intellekt sozlamalarida oshirishi mumkin.','Usage and cost'=>'Foydalanish va narx','The log, limits and role permissions apply to AI used through: %s.'=>'Jurnal, limitlar va rol ruxsatlari quyidagi orqali ishlatiladigan sun\'iy intellektga nisbatan qo\'llaniladi: %s.','Costs are approximate, worked out from published prices; a model with no known price counts as zero.'=>'Xarajatlar taxminiy bo‘lib, e’lon qilingan narxlardan kelib chiqqan holda hisoblangan; narxi noma’lum bo‘lgan model nolga teng deb olinadi.','This month: %1$s requests, about %2$s.'=>'Shu oy: %1$s ta so‘rov, taxminan %2$s.','When'=>'Qachon','Who'=>'Kim','Used for'=>'Ishlatiladi','Model'=>'Model','Tokens in / out'=>'Kirish / chiqish tokenlari','About'=>'Haqida','Result'=>'Natija','No AI requests have been made yet.'=>'Hali suniy intellekt so‘rovlari yuborilmagan.','Done'=>'Bajarildi','Limits and permissions'=>'Chegaralar va ruxsatlar','Monthly spending limit (US dollars)'=>'Oylik xarajat limiti (US dollari)','Leave empty for no limit. AI stops for the rest of the month once the approximate cost reaches it.'=>'Cheklov qo\'ymaslik uchun bo\'sh qoldiring. Taxminiy xarajat unga yetganda, sun\'iy intellekt oyning qolgan qismi uchun to\'xtaydi.','Monthly request limit'=>'Oylik so‘rovlar limiti','Leave empty for no limit.'=>'Cheklash qo\'ymaslik uchun bo\'sh qoldiring.','Who may use AI'=>'AI-dan kimlar foydalanishi mumkin','Tick none to let everyone who can use the plugin\'s features use AI. Administrators can always use it.'=>'Plagin funksiyalaridan foydalana oladigan har bir kishi sun\'iy intellektni ishlatishiga ruxsat berish uchun hech birini belimang. Administratorlar undan doimiy ravishda foydalanishi mumkin.','Save limits and permissions'=>'Cheklovlar va ruxsatlarni saqlash','Limits and permissions saved.'=>'Chegaralar va ruxsatlar saqlandi.','That language is not one of this site\'s languages.'=>'Bu til ushbu sayt tillaridan biri emas.','A translation must be the same kind of content as the original.'=>'Tarjima asl nusxa bilan bir xil turdagi kontent bo\'lishi kerak.','Choose one of the site\'s other languages.'=>'Saytning boshqa tillaridan birini tanlang.','The admin screen\'s scripts are missing from this copy of the plugin. Reinstall it from a released package.'=>'Plaginning ushbu nusxasida admin ekranining skriptlari mavjud emas. Uni chiqarilgan paketdan qayta o‘rnating.','This screen needs JavaScript.'=>'Ushbu ekran uchun JavaScript talab qilinadi.','Choose a language'=>'Tilni tanlang','Hosting customer? Get %1$d%% off %2$s'=>'Hosting mijozimisiz? %2$s dan %1$d%% chegirma oling','As a Zinn Digital® hosting customer you get a personal code for %d%% off your first payment. Renewals are at the normal price.'=>'Zinn Digital® xosting mijosi sifatida siz birinchi to‘lovingizdan %d%% chegirma olish uchun shaxsiy kodga ega bo‘lasiz. Keyingi to‘lovlar odatdagi narxda amalga oshiriladi.','Get my %d%% code and go to checkout'=>'%d%% kodimni oling va to\'lov sahifasiga o\'ting','This discount is for customers with a paid hosting plan in good standing. Free trials do not qualify.'=>'Bu chegirma faol va to\'lovi amalga oshirilgan hosting rejasiga ega mijozlar uchun amal qiladi. Bepul sinov muddatlari bunga kirmaydi.','You have already used your hosting-customer discount for this plugin.'=>'Siz bu plagin uchun hosting-mijoz chegirmangizdan allaqachon foylangansiz.','We could not get your code just now. Please try again in a few minutes.'=>'Kodongizni hozircha ololmadik. Iltimos, bir necha daqiqadan so\'ng yana urinib ko\'ring.','The prefix must be 1 to 8 lowercase letters or digits, start with a letter, and must not name the plugin.'=>'Prefiks 1 dan 8 gacha kichik harflar yoki raqamlardan iborat bo\'lishi, harf bilan boshlanishi va plagin nomiga teng bo\'lmasligi kerak.','"%s" is not a language code. Use a WordPress locale such as fr_FR or de_DE.'=>'"%s" til kodi emas. fr_FR yoki de_DE kabi WordPress til muhitidan foydalaning.','List at least one language.'=>'Kamida bitta tilni ko\'rsating.','Translations'=>'Tarjimalar','Edit the %s version'=>'%s versiyasini tahrirlash','Compare the %s version side by side'=>'%s versiyasini yonma-yon solishtiring','%1$s (%2$s)'=>'%1$s (%2$s)','Alternative text'=>'Muqobil matn','Caption'=>'Sarlavha','Title'=>'Sarlavha','Choose one of your menus for each language.'=>'Har bir til uchun menyularingizdan birini tanlang.','Save this post first, then translate it here.'=>'Avval bu xabarni saqlang, keyin uni bu yerda tarjima qiling.','This one'=>'Bu biri','Edit'=>'Tahrirlash','Side by side'=>'Yonma-yon','Translate again'=>'Qaytadan tarjima qilish','Translate'=>'Tarjima qilish','Create a copy to translate by hand'=>'Qo\'lda tarjima qilish uchun nusxa yaratish','Translate uses the engine set for that language. A version a person edited is never overwritten.'=>'Tarjima shu til uchun o‘rnatilgan dvigaterdan foydalanadi. Odam tahrirlagan versiya hech qachon ustidan yozib yuborilmaydi.','You are not allowed to translate this item.'=>'Sizga bu elementni tarjima qilishga ruxsat etilmagan.','%s: translated.'=>'%s: tarjima qilindi.','This is not a translation, so there is nothing to protect.'=>'Bu tarjima emas, shuning uchun himoya qilish uchun hech narsa yo\'q.','This kind of content is not translated.'=>'Bu turdagi kontent tarjima qilinmaydi.','Text %s is not on this site any more. Reload the page.'=>'%s matni endi bu saytda mavjud emas. Sahifani qayta yuklang.','No translation engine could take this text.'=>'Hech qanday tarjima dvigateli bu matnni qabul qila olmadi.','Choose one of your other languages.'=>'Boshqa tillaringizdan birini tanlang.','Compare translation'=>'Tarjimani solishtirish','You are not allowed to edit this translation.'=>'Sizga bu tarjimani tahrirlashga ruxsat etilmagan.','This is not a translation, so there is nothing to compare.'=>'Bu tarjima emas, shuning uchun taqqoslash uchun hech narsa yo\'q.','The original of this translation no longer exists.'=>'Ushbu tarjimaning asl nusxasi endi mavjud emas.','Piece %s is not part of this translation any more. Reload the page and try again.'=>'%s qismi endi ushbu tarjimaning bir qismi emas. Sahifani yangilang va qaytadan urinib ko\'ring.','Translate on this page'=>'Ushbu sahifada tarjima qilish','This item already has a version in that language.'=>'Bu element allaqachon bu tilda versiyaga ega.','That translation engine is not available on this site.'=>'Bu tarjima mexanizmi ushbu saytda mavjud emas.','Different engines per language, automatic fallback and spending caps are Tranzly Pro features.'=>'Har bir til uchun alohida tarjima dvigatellari, avtomatik zaxira va xarajatlar cheklovi Tranzly Pro funksiyalaridir.','Each language must be one of the site\'s languages, with an available engine.'=>'Har bir til sayt tillaridan biri bo\'lishi va mavjud dvigatelga ega bo\'lishi kerak.','The fallback list may only name available engines.'=>'Zaxira roʻyxatida faqat mavjud dvigatellar koʻrsatilishi mumkin.','A monthly cap is an amount in US dollars, zero or more, for an available engine.'=>'Oylik cheklov mavjud dvigatel uchun US dollaridagi miqdor boʻlib, nol yoki undan koʻproq boʻlishi mumkin.','Preferred translations and tone per language are Tranzly Pro features. The do-not-translate list is free.'=>'Afzal ko‘rilgan tarjimalar va ohang til bo‘yicha Tranzly Pro funksiyalari hisoblanadi. Tarjima qilinmaydiganlar ro‘yxati bepul.','Glossary entries must be grouped by one of the site\'s languages.'=>'Lugʻat yozuvlari sayt tillaridan biri boʻyicha guruhlanishi shart.','Tone is set per site language: formality default, more or less, plus optional instructions.'=>'Ohang har bir sayt tili uchun o‘rnatiladi: odatiy rasmiylik darajasi, ko‘proq yoki kamroq, shuningdek qo‘shimcha ko‘rsatmalar.','The value for %s is not one of the allowed choices.'=>'%s uchun qiymat ruxsat etilgan variantlardan biri emas.','The background queue is not available on this site.'=>'Bu saytda fon navbati mavjud emas.','A translation job runs as the person who starts it, so a user must be signed in.'=>'Tarjima vazifasi uni boshlagan shaxs nomidan bajariladi, shuning uchun foydalanuvchi tizimga kirgan bo\'lishi shart.','There is nothing you are allowed to translate in that selection.'=>'Sizga ushbu tanlovda tarjima qilishga ruxsat berilgan hech narsa yo\'q.','That item is not part of a translation job.'=>'Ushbu element tarjima vazifasining bir qismi emas.','You are not allowed to change that translation.'=>'Bu tarjimani o\'zgartirishga ruxsat berilmagan.','This item\'s group already has a %1$s version (#%2$d).'=>'Bu element guruhining allaqachon %1$s versiyasi mavjud (#%2$d).','An item cannot be its own translation.'=>'Element o\'zining tarjimasi bo\'la olmaydi.','That item is already a translation of something else. Unlink it first.'=>'Bu element allaqachon boshqa narsaning tarjimasi hisoblanadi. Avval uni bog\'lanishdan chiqaring.','The translation link could not be saved.'=>'Tarjima havolasini saqlab bo\'lmadi.','That text cannot be translated here.'=>'Bu matnni bu yerda tarjima qilib bo‘lmaydi.','That media text cannot be translated here.'=>'Ushbu media matnni bu yerda tarjima qilib bo\'lmaydi.','A translation can be published or kept as a draft.'=>'Tarjima chop etilishi yoki qoralama sifatida saqlanishi mumkin.','You are not allowed to publish this kind of content.'=>'Sizga bu turdagi kontentni nashr etishga ruxsat etilmagan.','This item is already written in that language.'=>'Bu element allaqachon shu tilda yozilgan.','This translation was edited by a person (or imported), so it is protected. Unlock it to translate it again.'=>'Bu tarjima inson tomonidan tahrirlangan (yoki import qilingan), shuning uchun u himoyalangan. Uni qayta tarjima qilish uchun qulfni oching.','That item does not exist.'=>'Bunday element mavjud emas.','No translation engine is set up yet. Add a key for one in Tranzly → Engines.'=>'Hali hech qanday tarjima dvigateli o‘rnatilmagan. Tranzly → Engines bo‘limida buning uchun kalit qo‘shing.','That translation engine is not set up yet: add its key first.'=>'Bu tarjima dvigeli hali sozlangan emas: avval uning kalitini qo\'shing.','The same text is being translated by another job right now; this item will use that answer.'=>'Ayni paytda xuddi shu matn boshqa vazifa doirasida tarjima qilinmoqda; bu element o\'sha javobdan foydalanadi.','No translation engine could take this item.'=>'Hech qanday tarjima dvigateli bu elementni qabul qila olmadi.','The engine did not return a translation for every part of this item. Nothing was changed.'=>'Dvigatel ushbu elementning har bir qismi uchun tarjimani qaytarmadi. Hech narsa o\'zgartirilmadi.','AI model'=>'Sun\'iy intellekt modeli','AI model (%1$s %2$s)'=>'AI modeli (%1$s %2$s)','%s is having problems right now. Try again shortly, or use another engine.'=>'%s da hozirda muammolar kuzatilmoqda. Ozgina vaqt o\'tib qayta urinib ko\'ring yoki boshqa qidiruv tizimidan foydalaning.','Your site could not reach %s. Check that it can make outgoing connections, then try again.'=>'Saytingiz %s manziliga ulanib bo‘lmadi. U chiquvchi ulanishlarni o‘rnatishi mumkinligini tekshiring va qaytadan urinib ko‘ring.','%s did not accept your API key. Check the key in Tranzly → Engines.'=>'%s API kalitingizni qabul qilmadi. Tranzly → Engines bo\'limida kalitni tekshiring.','Your %s account has used up its quota or balance. Top it up with them, or use another engine.'=>'Sizning %s hisobingiz kvotasi yoki balansidan toʻliq foydalanib boʻldi. Uni toʻldiring yoki boshqa drayverdan foydalaning.','%s asked us to slow down. It will be tried again automatically.'=>'%s tezlikni pasaytirishimizni so\'radi. U avtomatik ravishda qayta urinib ko\'riladi.','This text is too long for %s in one go. Split the content, or use another engine.'=>'Bu matn %s uchun bir yo‘la juda uzun. Tarkibni bo‘ling yoki boshqa dvigateldan foydalaning.','%s refused to translate this content. Try another engine, or translate it by hand.'=>'%s bu kontentni tarjima qilishdan bosh tortdi. Boshqa tizimni sinab ko\'ring yoki uni qo\'lda tarjima qiling.','%s does not translate this language. Choose another engine for it.'=>'%s bu tilni tarjima qilmaydi. Buning uchun boshqa tarjima dvigatelini tanlang.','This month\'s spending cap for %s is reached, so nothing more was sent to it. Raise the cap in Tranzly → Engines, or wait until next month.'=>'%s uchun joriy oylik xarajatlar limiti tugadi, shuning uchun boshqa hech narsa yuborilmadi. Limiti Tranzly → Engines orqali oshiring yoki kelasi oyni kuting.','The translation with %s failed for a reason Tranzly could not identify. The details are below.'=>'%s yordamidagi tarjima Tranzly aniqlay olmagan sababga ko\'ra bajarilmadi. Tafsilotlar quyida keltirilgan.','An engine id must be lowercase letters, digits and hyphens.'=>'Dvigatel identifikatori kichik harflar, raqamlar va defislardan iborat boʻlishi kerak.','Part of the message telling the user what they should receive via email.a license key'=>'litsenziya kaliti','A user has not yet been associated with the license, which is necessary to prevent unauthorized activation. To assign the license to your user, you agree to share your WordPress user\'s full name and email address.'=>'Litsenziya bilan hali foydalanuvchi biriktirilmagan, bu ruxsatsiz faollashtirishning oldini olish uchun zarur. Litsenziyani foydalanuvchingizga tayinlash orqali siz WordPress foydalanuvchingizning to‘liq ismi va elektron pochta manzilini ulashishga rozilik bildirasiz.','the above-mentioned sites'=>'yuqorida tilga olingan saytlar','Account'=>'Hisob','Account Details'=>'Hisob tafsilotlari','Account is pending activation. Please check your email and click the link to activate your account and then submit the affiliate form again.'=>'Hisob faollashtirilishini kutmoqda. Hisobingizni faollashtirish uchun elektron pochtangizni tekshiring va havolani bosing, shundan so\'ng sheriklik formasini qaytadan yuboring.','Would you like to merge %1$s into %2$s?'=>'%1$s ni %2$s bilan birlashtirmoqchimisiz?','Actions'=>'Amallar','Activate'=>'Faollashtirish','Activate Free Version'=>'Bepul versiyani faollashtirish','Activate License'=>'Litsenziyani faollashtirish','activate a license here'=>'litsenziyani bu yerda faollashtirish','Please enter the license key that you received in the email right after the purchase:'=>'Iltimos, xarid qilganingizdan keyin darhol elektron pochtangizga kelgan litsenziya kalitini kiriting:','Activate license on all sites in the network.'=>'Tarmoqdagi barcha saytlarda litsenziyani faollashtirish.','Activate license on all pending sites.'=>'Barcha kutilayotgan saytlarda litsenziyani faollashtirish.',' The paid version of %1$s is already installed. Please activate it to start benefiting from the %2$s features. %3$s'=>'%1$s ning pullik versiyasi allaqachon oʻrnatilgan. %2$s funksiyalaridan foydalanishni boshlash uchun uni faollashtiring. %3$s',' The paid version of %1$s is already installed. Please navigate to the %2$s to activate it and start benefiting from the %3$s features.'=>'%1$s ning pulli versiyasi allaqachon o\'rnatilgan. Uni faollashtirish va %3$s funksiyalaridan foydalanishni boshlash uchun %2$s bo\'limiga o\'ting.','Activate this add-on'=>'Ushbu qo‘shimchani faollashtirish','Activate %s'=>'%s ni faollashtirish','Activate %s features'=>'%s funksiyalarini faollashtirish','%s - plugin name. As complete "PluginX" activation nowComplete "%s" Activation Now'=>'"%s" faollashtirishni hoziroq yakunlash','Activate %s Plan'=>'%s rejasini faollashtirish','Activated'=>'Faollashtirilgan','Activating'=>'Faollashtirilmoqda','Activating license'=>'Litsenziya faollashtirilmoqda','Your account was successfully activated with the %s plan.'=>'Hisobingiz %s tarifi bilan muvaffaqiyatli faollashtirildi.','active add-onActive'=>'Faol','Add another domain'=>'Boshqa domen qo\'shish','Add-Ons'=>'Qo\'shimchalar','Add Ons for %s'=>'%s uchun qo‘shimchalar','We couldn\'t load the add-ons list. It\'s probably an issue on our side, please try to come back in few minutes.'=>'Qoʻshimchalar roʻyxatini yuklay olmadik. Bu, ehtimol, biz tomondagi muammo, iltimos, bir necha daqiqadan soʻng qayta urinib koʻring.','Add-On'=>'Qo\'shimcha','%s is a premium only add-on. You have to purchase a license first before activating the plugin.'=>'%s faqat premium qoʻshimcha hisoblanadi. Plaginni faollashtirishdan oldin litsenziya sotib olishingiz kerak.','%s Add-on was successfully purchased.'=>'%s qo\'shimchasi muvaffaqiyatli sotib olindi.','Your %s Add-on plan was successfully upgraded.'=>'Sizning %s qo\'shimcha rejangiz muvaffaqiyatli yangilandi.','%s free trial was successfully cancelled. Since the add-on is premium only it was automatically deactivated. If you like to use it in the future, you\'ll have to purchase a license.'=>'%s bepul sinov muddati muvaffaqiyatli bekor qilindi. Qo\'shimcha faqat premium bo\'lgani sababli, u avtomatik ravishda o\'chirib qo\'yildi. Agar kelajakda undan foydalanishni istasangiz, litsenziya sotib olishingiz kerak bo\'ladi.','addonX cannot run...%s cannot run without the plugin.'=>'%s plaginlarsiz ishlay olmaydi.','addonX cannot run without pluginY%1$s cannot run without %2$s.'=>'%1$s %2$s siz ishlay olmaydi.','Just letting you know that the add-ons information of %s is being pulled from an external server.'=>'Shunchaki shuni ma\'lum qilamizki, %s ning qo\'shimcha imkoniyatlar haqidagi ma\'lumotlari tashqi serverdan olinmoqda.','Add Ons of module %s'=>'%s modulining qo\'shimchalari','Address Line %d'=>'Manzil qatori %d','Affiliate'=>'Hamkor','Due to violation of our affiliation terms, we decided to temporarily block your affiliation account. If you have any questions, please contact support.'=>'Hamkorlik shartlarini buzganligingiz sababli, hamkorlik akkauntingizni vaqtincha bloklashga qaror qildik. Agar savollaringiz bo\'lsa, qo\'llab-quvvatlash xizmatiga murojaat qiling.','Your affiliation account was temporarily suspended.'=>'Hamkorlik hisobingiz vaqtincha toʻxtatib turildi.','Your affiliate application for %1$s has been accepted! Log in to your affiliate area at: %2$s.'=>'%1$s bo\'yicha hamkorlik arizangiz qabul qilindi! Hamkorlik bo\'limiga kiring: %2$s.','Thank you for applying for our affiliate program, unfortunately, we\'ve decided at this point to reject your application. Please try again in 30 days.'=>'Sheriklik dasturimizga topshirgan arizangiz uchun rahmat, afsuski, bu safar arizangizni rad etishga qaror qildik. Iltimos, 30 kundan keyin yana urinib ko\'ring.','Thank you for applying for our affiliate program, we\'ll review your details during the next 14 days and will get back to you with further information.'=>'Affiliat dasturimizga ariza topshirganingiz uchun rahmat, biz keyingi 14 kun ichida ma\'lumotlaringizni ko\'rib chiqamiz va qo\'shimcha ma\'lumotlar bilan siz bilan bog\'lanamiz.','%s tracking cookie after the first visit to maximize earnings potential.'=>'Daromad salohiyatini oshirish uchun birinchi tashrifdan keyin %s kuzatuv rejadagi (cookie) fayli.','Affiliation'=>'Hamkorlik','Once your license expires you can still use the Free version but you will NOT have access to the %s features.'=>'Litsenziyangiz muddati tugagandan so\'ng siz Free versiyasidan foydalanishda davom etishingiz mumkin, lekin %s funksiyalariga kirish huquqiga ega bo\'lmaysiz.','Once your license expires you will no longer be able to use the %s, unless you activate it again with a valid premium license.'=>'Litsenziyangiz muddati tugagandan so\'ng, agar uni yaroqli premium litsenziya bilan qayta faollashtirmasangiz, %s dan foydalana olmaysiz.','You can still enjoy all %1$s features but you will not have access to %2$s security & feature updates, nor support.'=>'Siz hali ham barcha %1$s funksiyalaridan foydalanishingiz mumkin, biroq %2$s xavfsizlik va funksiya yangilanishlariga, shuningdek, qo‘llab-quvvatlash xizmatiga ega bo‘lmaysiz.','Thanks for upgrading.'=>'Yangilaganingiz uchun rahmat.','After your free %1$s, pay as little as %2$s'=>'Bepul %1$s davridan keyiniga atigi %2$s toʻlang','Agree & Activate License'=>'Litsenziyani qabul qilish va faollashtirish','I Agree - Change User'=>'Men roziman - Foydalanuvchini o\'zgartirish','All Requests'=>'Barcha so‘rovlar','All Types'=>'Barcha turlar','allow'=>'ruxsat berish','You\'ve already opted-in to our usage-tracking, which helps us keep improving the %s.'=>'Siz allaqachon %s ni yaxshilashga yordam beradigan foydalanishni kuzatishimizga rozi bo‘lgansiz.','You\'ve already opted-in to our usage-tracking, which helps us keep improving them.'=>'Siz allaqachon ularni yanada yaxshilashimizga yordam beradigan foydalanishni kuzatishimizga rozi bo‘lgansiz.','Amount'=>'Miqdor','as once a yearAnnual'=>'Yillik','as once a yearAnnually'=>'Yillik','Anonymous feedback'=>'Anonim fikr-mulohaza','as application program interfaceAPI'=>'API','Apply on all sites in the network.'=>'Tarmoqdagi barcha saytlarga qo\'llash.','Apply on all pending sites.'=>'Barcha kutilayotgan saytlarga nisbatan qo\'llash.','Apply to become an affiliate'=>'Hamkor bo\'lish uchun ariza topshiring','Approve & Start Trial'=>'Tasdiqlash va sinov muddatini boshlash','Kindly tell us the reason so we can improve.'=>'Takomillashishimiz uchun iltimos, sababini bizga ayting.','Enter the email address you\'ve used for the upgrade below and we will resend you the license key.'=>'Yangilash uchun foydalangan elektron pochta manzilingizni quyida kiriting va biz litsenziya kalitini qaytadan yuboramiz.','Enter the email address you\'ve used during the purchase and we will resend you the license key.'=>'Xarid qilishda foydalangan elektron pochta manzilingizni kiriting va biz litsenziya kalitini sizga qayta yuboramiz.','Associate with the license owner\'s account.'=>'Litsenziya egasining hisobiga bog\'lanish.','as the plugin authorAuthor'=>'Muallif','Invalid module ID.'=>'Noto\'g\'ri modul ID raqami.','You do not have a valid license to access the premium version.'=>'Premium versiyaga kirish uchun amal qiladigan litsenziyangiz yo‘q.','Auto installation only works for opted-in users.'=>'Avtomatik o‘rnatish faqat ro‘yxatdan o‘tgan foydalanuvchilar uchun ishlaydi.','Premium version already active.'=>'Premial versiya allaqachon faol.','Premium add-on version already installed.'=>'Premium qo\'shimcha versiyasi allaqachon o\'rnatilgan.','Plugin is a "Serviceware" which means it does not have a premium code version.'=>'Plagin "Serviceware" hisoblanadi, ya\'ni uning pullik kod versiyasi mavjud emas.','Automatic Installation'=>'Avtomatik oʻrnatish','timer for auto-disabling debugAuto off in:'=>'Avtomatik o‘chish vaqti:','Average Rating'=>'O\'rtacha reyting','Awesome'=>'Ajoyib','based on %s'=>'%s asosida','Become an affiliate'=>'Hamkor bo‘lish','Like the %s? Become our ambassador and earn cash ;-)'=>'%s yoqdimi? Bizning elchimiz bo\'ling va pul ishlang ;-)','Hey there, did you know that %1$s has an affiliate program? If you like the %2$s you can become our ambassador and earn some cash!'=>'Salom, %1$s dasturining hamkorlik dasturi borligini bilsarmidingiz? Agar %2$s sizga yoqsa, elchimizga aylanib, pul topishingiz mumkin!','e.g. the best productBest'=>'Eng yaxshi','Beta'=>'Beta','An update to a Beta version will replace your installed version of %s with the latest Beta release - use with caution, and not on production sites. You have been warned.'=>'Beta versiyasiga yangilash %s ning o\'rnatilgan versiyasini eng so\'nggi Beta relizi bilan almashtiradi - ehtiyotkorlik bilan foydalaning va uni produktiv saytlarda ishlatmang. Siz ogohlantirildingiz.','e.g. billed monthlyBilled %s'=>'%s bo\'yicha hisoblangan','Billing'=>'Hisob-kitob','Billing & Invoices'=>'Hisob-kitoblar va schyotlar','as connection blockedBlocked'=>'Bloklangan','Blocking'=>'Bloklanmoqda','Blog ID'=>'Blog ID','Body'=>'Asosiy qism','Yes - both addresses are mine'=>'Ha - ikkala manzil ham o\'zimniki','Bundle'=>'To\'plam','Bundle Plan'=>'To\'plam rejasi','Business name'=>'Korxona nomi','Buy license'=>'Litsenziyani sotib olish','Buy a license now'=>'Hozir litsenziya sotib oling','Cancel'=>'Bekor qilish','Cancel Installation'=>'Oʻrnatishni bekor qilish','Cancel Subscription'=>'Obunani bekor qilish','In case you are NOT planning on using this %1$s on this site (or any other site) - would you like to cancel the %2$s as well?'=>'Agar ushbu %1$s ni ushbu saytda (yoki boshqa biron bir saytda) ishlatishni rejalashtirmayotgan boʻlsangiz, %2$s ni ham bekor qilishni xohlaysizmi?','Cancel Trial'=>'Sinov muddatini bekor qilish','Cancelling the trial will immediately block access to all premium features. Are you sure?'=>'Sinov davrini bekor qilish barcha premium funksiyalarga kirishni darhol bloklaydi. Ishonchingiz komilmi?','Cancel %s & Proceed'=>'%s ni bekor qilish va davom etish','Cancelled'=>'Bekor qilingan','Cancelling the subscription'=>'Obunani bekor qilish','Can\'t find your license key?'=>'Litsenziya kalitingizni topa olmayapsizmi?','Change License'=>'Litsenziyani oʻzgartirish','A confirmation email was just sent to %s. You must confirm the update within the next 4 hours. If you cannot find the email, please check your spam folder.'=>'Tasdiqlash xati %s manziliga yuborildi. Siz yangilanishni keyingi 4 soat ichida tasdiqlashingiz shart. Agar xatni topa olmasangiz, iltimos, spam papkasini tekshiring.','A confirmation email was just sent to %s. The email owner must confirm the update within the next 4 hours.'=>'Tasdiqlash xati hozirgina %s manziliga yuborildi. Xat egasi yangilanishni keyingi 4 soat ichida tasdiqlashi shart.','%s is the new owner of the account.'=>'%s — hisob raqamining yangi egasi.','Thanks for confirming the ownership change. An email was just sent to %s for final approval.'=>'Egalik huquqining o\'zgartirilishini tasdiqlaganingiz uchun rahmat. Yakuniy tasdiqlash uchun %s manziliga hozirgina xat yuborildi.','Change Ownership'=>'Egalik huquqini o\'zgartirish','Change Plan'=>'Rejani o\'zgartirish','Change User'=>'Foydalanuvchini oʻzgartirish','By changing the user, you agree to transfer the account ownership to:'=>'Foydalanuvchini o\'zgartirish orqali siz hisob egaligini quyidagiga o\'tkazishga rozilik bildirasiz:','Plugin installer section titleChangelog'=>'O‘zgarishlar tarixi','Changing user, please wait'=>'Foydalanuvchi oʻzgartirilmoqda, iltimos kuting','If you didn\'t get the email, try checking your spam folder or search for emails from %4$s.'=>'Agar xat kelmagan bo\'lsa, spam papkasini tekshirib ko\'ring yoki %4$s manzilidan kelgan xatlarni qidiring.','Checkout'=>'Buyurtma berish','Choose up to %s site(s) to activate the license on.'=>'Litsenziyani faollashtirish uchun %s tagacha saytni tanlang.','City'=>'Shahar','Clear API Cache'=>'API keshini tozalash','Clear Updates Transients'=>'Yangilanishlar vaqtincha ma\'lumotlarini tozalash','Part of an activation link message.Click here'=>'Bu yerni bosing','Click here to use the plugin anonymously'=>'Plagindan anonim ravishda foydalanish uchun bu yerni bosing','Click to see reviews that provided a rating of %s'=>'%s reytingini bergan sharhlarni ko\'rish uchun bosing','%s is my client\'s email address'=>'%s – mijozimning elektron pochta manzili','Code'=>'Kod','%s commission when a customer purchases a new license.'=>'Mijoz yangi litsenziya sotib olganda %s komissiya.','As we reserve 30 days for potential refunds, we only pay commissions that are older than 30 days.'=>'Potensial qaytarishlar uchun 30 kun saqlab qo‘yilishini hisobga olib, biz faqat 30 kundan oshgan komissiya to‘lovlarini amalga oshiramiz.','Communication'=>'Aloqa','Compatible up to'=>'Quyidagicha mos keladi','complete the opt-in'=>'obunani yakunlash','as congratulationsCongrats'=>'Tabriklaymiz','Never miss an important update'=>'Muhim yangilanishni hech qachon o\'tkazib yubormang','Thank you for updating to %1$s v%2$s!'=>'%1$s v%2$s versiyasiga yanginganingiz uchun rahmat!','Opt in to get email notifications for security & feature updates, educational content, and occasional offers, and to share some basic WordPress environment info. This will help us make the %s more compatible with your site and better at doing what you need it to.'=>'Xavfsizlik va funksiya yangilanishlari, ta’limiy kontent va vaqti-vaqti bilan taqdim etiladigan takliflar bo‘yicha elektron pochta xabarnomalarini olish hamda asosiy WordPress muhiti haqida ayrim ma’lumotlarni ulashish uchun rozilik bildiring. Bu bizga %s\'ni saytingizga moslashuvchanroq qilishga va sizga kerakli vazifalarni yanada yaxshiroq bajarishiga yordam beradi.','Opt in to get email notifications for security & feature updates, educational content, and occasional offers, and to share some basic WordPress environment info.'=>'Xavfsizlik va funksiya yangilanishlari, ta\'limiy kontent hamda vaqti-vaqti bilan taqdim etiladigan takliflar bo\'yicha elektron pochta xabarnomalarini olish hamda ba\'zi asosiy WordPress muhiti ma\'lumotlarini ulashish uchun ro\'yxatdan o\'ting.','If you skip this, that\'s okay! %1$s will still work just fine.'=>'Buni o\'tkazib yuborsangiz ham muammo yo\'q! %1$s baribir yaxshi ishlayveradi.','We have introduced this opt-in so you never miss an important update and help us make the %s more compatible with your site and better at doing what you need it to.'=>'Biz ushbu qo‘shilish imkoniyatini taqdim etdik, shunda siz hech qanday muhim yangilanishni o‘tkazib yubormaysiz va %s vositasini veb-saytingizga moslashuvchanroq qilishimizda hamda sizga kerakli vazifalarni bajarishda yaxshiroq ishlashiga yordam berasiz.','We\'re excited to introduce the Freemius network-level integration.'=>'Biz Freemius tarmoq darajasidagi integratsiyani taqdim etishdan mamnunmiz.','During the update process we detected %s site(s) in the network that are still pending your attention.'=>'Yangilash jarayonida tarmoqda hali e\'tiboringizni talab qiladigan %s ta sayt aniqlandi.','During the update process we detected %d site(s) that are still pending license activation.'=>'Yangilash jarayonida litsenziyasi hali faollashtirilmagan %d ta sayt aniqlandi.','If you\'d like to use the %s on those sites, please enter your license key below and click the activation button.'=>'Agar bu saytlarda %s dan foydalanishni istasangiz, iltimos, litsenziya kalitingizni quyiga kiriting va faollashtirish tugmasini bosing.','Alternatively, you can skip it for now and activate the license later, in your %s\'s network-level Account page.'=>'Shuningdek, buni hozircha oʻtkazib yuborishingiz va litsenziyani keyinroq %s tarmogʻi darajasidagi Hisob qaydnomasi sahifasida faollashtirishingiz mumkin.','as connection was successfulConnected'=>'Ulangan','Once you are done, deactivate the %s and activate it again.'=>'Tugatganingizdan so\'ng, %s ni o\'chiring va uni qaytadan faollashtiring.','Contact'=>'Aloqa','Please let us know if you\'d like us to contact you for security & feature updates, educational content, and occasional offers:'=>'Xavfsizlik va funksiyalar yangilanishlari, o‘quv materiallari va vaqti-vaqti bilan taqdim etiladigan takliflar bo‘yicha siz bilan bog‘lanishimizni istasangiz, iltimos, bizga xabar bering:','Contact Support'=>'Qo\'llab-quvvatlash xizmati bilan bog\'lanish','Sorry for the inconvenience and we are here to help if you give us a chance.'=>'Nogulaylik uchun uzr so\'raymiz va agar bizga imkon bersangiz, yordam berishga tayyormiz.','Contact Us'=>'Biz bilan bog\'laning','Please contact us here'=>'Iltimos, bu yerda biz bilan bog\'laning','Please contact us with the following message:'=>'Iltimos, biz bilan quyidagi xabar orqali bog\'laning:','Continue'=>'Davom etish','Contributors'=>'Ishtirokchilar','Couldn\'t activate %s.'=>'%s ni faollashtirib bo‘lmadi.','Country'=>'Mamlakat','Cron Type'=>'Kron turi','We use PHP cURL library for the API calls, which is a very common library and usually installed and activated out of the box. Unfortunately, cURL is not activated (or disabled) on your server.'=>'API so\'rovlari uchun biz PHP cURL kutubxonasidan foydalanamiz, bu juda keng tarqalgan kutubxona bo\'lib, odatda o\'rnatilgan va sukut bo\'yicha faollashtirilgan bo\'ladi. Afsuski, serveringizda cURL faollashtirilmagan (yoki o\'