'=>'Saytlar','nounPricing'=>'Narxlar','trial periodTrial'=>'Sinov muddati','verbOpt In'=>'Obuna bo‘lish','verbOpt Out'=>'Voz kechish','verbSkip'=>'Oʻtkazib yuborish','verbUpgrade'=>'Yangilash','x-ago%s ago'=>'%s oldin','Blocks with repeated items, and synced patterns'=>'Takrorlanuvchi elementlarga ega bloklar va sinxronlashtirilgan naqshlar','WooCommerce products'=>'WooCommerce mahsulotlari','Comments and reviews'=>'Sharhlar va taqrizlar','Translated automatically from %s.'=>'%s tilidan avtomatik ravishda tarjima qilingan.','WooCommerce currencies'=>'WooCommerce valyutalari','Currency'=>'Valyuta','The rate source does not quote %s, the shop\'s currency.'=>'Kurs manbasi do\'konning valyutasi bo\'lgan %s uchun narx bermayapti.','"%s" is not a currency WooCommerce knows, or it is the shop\'s own currency.'=>'"%s" bu WooCommerce taniy olmaydigan valyuta yoki do‘konning o‘z valyutasidir.','Enter a rate above zero for %s, like 0.92.'=>'%s uchun noldan katta stavka kiriting, masalan, 0.92.','Rounding steps and price endings are amounts, like 0.05 or 0.99.'=>'Y yaxlitlash qadamlari va narx yakunlari 0.05 yoki 0.99 kabi miqdorlardir.','Custom fields (ACF, Meta Box, Pods)'=>'Maxsus maydonlar (ACF, Meta Box, Pods)','Choose translate, copy or leave empty for each field.'=>'Har bir maydon uchun tarjima qilish, nusxalash yoki bo‘sh qoldirishni tanlang.','Forms (Contact Form 7, WPForms, Gravity Forms, Fluent Forms)'=>'Formalar (Contact Form 7, WPForms, Gravity Forms, Fluent Forms)','I enter the rates myself'=>'Tarriflarni o\'zim kiritaman','European Central Bank, updated daily (free, no account needed)'=>'Yevropa Markaziy Banki, kunlik yangilanadi (bepul, akkaunt talab qilinmaydi)','The European Central Bank answered %d. The last rates are kept.'=>'Yevropa markaziy banki %d ta javob berdi. Oxirgi stavkalar saqlanib qoldi.','The European Central Bank\'s feed held no rates. The last rates are kept.'=>'Yevropa Markaziy bankining tasmasida stavkalar bo\'lmadi. Oxirgi stavkalar saqlanib qoladi.','That exchange-rate source is not available.'=>'Valyuta kursi manbasi mavjud emas.','SEO plugins (Yoast SEO, Rank Math, SEOPress, All in One SEO)'=>'SEO plaginlari (Yoast SEO, Rank Math, SEOPress, All in One SEO)','Theme and plugin text'=>'Mavzu va plagin matni','That theme or plugin is not active on this site.'=>'Bu mavzu yoki plagin ushbu saytda faol emas.','The action could not be completed. Try again, and if it keeps failing, contact the site administrator.'=>'Amalni bajarib bo‘lmadi. Qaytadan urinib ko‘ring, agar xatolik takrorlanaversa, sayt maʼmuriga murojaat qiling.','A required value is missing or has the wrong form. Check the ability\'s input schema.'=>'Majburiy qiymat yetishmayapti yoki noto\'g\'ri shaklda. Imkoniyatning kiritish sxemasini tekshiring.','AI agents (MCP)'=>'AI agentlar (MCP)','Let AI assistants such as Claude, ChatGPT, Cursor or VS Code work on this site for you through MCP (Model Context Protocol). They sign in as a WordPress user with an application password and can do only what that user is allowed to do.'=>'Claude, ChatGPT, Cursor yoki VS Code kabi sun\'iy intellekt yordamchilariga MCP (Model Context Protocol) orqali ushbu saytda siz uchun ishlashiga ruxsat bering. Ular ilova paroli bilan WordPress foydalanuvchisi sifatida tizimga kiradi va faqat o\'sha foydalanuvchiga ruxsat etilgan amalni bajarishi mumkin.','AI agents need WordPress 6.9 or later. Update WordPress to use them.'=>'AI agentlari WordPress 6.9 yoki undan keyingi versiyasini talab qiladi. Ulardan foydalanish uchun WordPress\'ni yangilang.','Allow AI agents (MCP)'=>'AI agentlarga ruxsat berish (MCP)','Off: the tools below and their REST routes are not registered at all.'=>'O‘chiq: quyidagi vositalar va ularning REST marshrutlari umuman ro‘yxatdan o‘tkazilmagan.','Connection address (MCP endpoint)'=>'U ulanish manzili (MCP yakuniy nuqtasi)','Create an application password for your user'=>'Foydalanuvchingiz uchun dastur parolini yarating','Add this to your AI app’s MCP settings, with your username and that password:'=>'Buni foydalanuvchi nomingiz va ushbu parol bilan birga sun\'iy intellekt ilovangizning MCP sozlamalariga qo\'shing:','Tools an AI agent can use here (%d):'=>'Bu yerda sun\'iy intellekt agenti foydalanishi mumkin bo\'lgan vositalar (%d):','User guide: AI agents and MCP'=>'Foydalanuvchi qoʻllanmasi: AI agentlari va MCP','Developer docs: abilities, REST and MCP'=>'Dasturchi hujjatlari: imkoniyatlar, REST va MCP','Translate this site\'s content and check its translations with Tranzly.'=>'Tranzly yordamida ushbu sayt mazmunini tarjima qiling va uning tarjimalarini tekshiring.','Languages, translation and translation status.'=>'Tillar, tarjima va tarjima holati.','List languages'=>'Tillar roʻyxati','Lists the site\'s languages. The first one is the language the original content is written in.'=>'Sayt tillarini roʻyxatga oladi. Birinchisi — asl kontent yozilgan til.','List translation engines'=>'Tarjima mexanizmlari roʻyxati','Lists the translation engines, whether each is set up, and which one is used when none is named.'=>'Tarjima mexanizmlari, ularning har biri sozlanganligi va hech biri ko\'rsatilmaganda qaysi biri ishlatilishini ro\'yxatlaydi.','Translate a post or page'=>'Maqola yoki sahifani tarjima qilish','Translates one post or page into one or more of the site\'s languages with a translation engine, creating each translation or updating it. New translations are drafts unless publish is true. A translation a person edited is skipped unless force is true.'=>'Tarjima dvigateli yordamida bitta yozuv yoki sahifani saytning bir yoki bir nechta tillariga tarjima qiladi, har bir tarjimani yaratadi yoki yangilaydi. Nashr qilish true bo\'lmasa, yangi tarjimalar qoralama bo\'ladi. Odam tahrirlagan tarjima, agar majburlash true bo\'lmasa, o\'tkazib yuboriladi.','Language codes from tranzly/list-languages, e.g. de_DE, or just de when only one German is listed.'=>'tranzly/list-languages dagi til kodlari, masalan, de_DE yoki faqat bitta nemis tili ko\'rsatilgan bo\'lsa, shunchaki de.','An engine id from tranzly/list-engines; the default engine when omitted.'=>'tranzly/list-engines dan olingan dvigatel identifikatori; tashlab yuborilganda standart dvigatel.','Translation status'=>'Tarjima holati','With a post ID: each language\'s translation of that post, whether it is out of date, and who wrote it. Without one: how much of the site is translated, per language.'=>'Post identifikatori bilan: har bir til uchun o\'sha postning tarjimasi, u eskirganmi yoki yo\'qmi va uni kim yozgani. Identifikatorsiz: saytning qaysi qismi har bir til bo\'yicha tarjima qilingani.','Translate my site'=>'Saytimni tarjima qilish','A guided workflow: the agent checks the languages and engine, estimates the cost, and translates what is missing, asking before it spends or publishes.'=>'Yo\'naltirilgan ish jarayoni: agent tillar va dvigatelni tekshiradi, xarajatni baholaydi va yetishmayotgan qismini tarjima qiladi, xarajat qilish yoki e\'lon qilishdan oldin ruxsat so\'raydi.','The languages to translate into, e.g. German and French.'=>'Tarjima qilinadigan tillar, masalan, nemis va fransuz tillari.','Translate this WordPress site into: %s. Steps: 1) call tranzly-list-languages; if a language is missing, ask me before adding it with tranzly-update-settings; 2) call tranzly-list-engines and make sure one is set up (otherwise tell me which key to add); 3) call tranzly-translation-status for the whole site and tranzly-estimate for what is missing, and tell me the cost before spending anything; 4) after I agree, translate with tranzly-bulk-translate if it is available (Pro), otherwise post by post with tranzly-translate-post; 5) new translations stay drafts unless I say to publish; 6) finish with tranzly-translation-status and list what is still missing.'=>'Bu WordPress saytini quyidagi tilga tarjima qiling: %s. Qadamlar: 1) tranzly-list-languages ni chaqiring; agar til yetishmasa, tranzly-update-settings yordamida qoʻshishdan oldin mendan soʻrang; 2) tranzly-list-engines ni chaqiring va bittasi sozlanganligiga ishonch hosil qiling (aks holda qaysi kalitni qoʻshish kerakligini ayting); 3) butun sayt uchun tranzly-translation-status ni va yetishmayotgan qism uchun tranzly-estimate ni chaqiring, hamda biror narsa sarflashdan oldin menga narxini ayting; 4) men rozilik bildirganimdan soʻng, agar mavjud boʻlsa (Pro) tranzly-bulk-translate bilan, aks holda tranzly-translate-post yordamida har bir postni alohida tarjima qiling; 5) men nashr etishni buyurmagunimcha, yangi tarjimalar qoralama holatida qoladi; 6) tranzly-translation-status bilan yakunlang va hali ham nimalar yetishmayotganini sanab oʻting.','Name at least one language.'=>'Kamida bitta tilni kiriting.','Read comment handling (Pro)'=>'Izohlar bilan ishlashni o\'qish (Pro)','Returns whether comments are shared across languages or kept per language.'=>'Sharhlar tillar o\'rtasida umumiy yoki har bir til uchun alohida saqlanishini qaytaradi.','Change comment handling (Pro)'=>'Izohlar boshqaruvini o\'zgartirish (Pro)','Shares comments across a post\'s translations or keeps them per language (mode).'=>'Post tarjimalari bo\'ylab izohlarni ulashadi yoki ularni har bir til bo\'yicha alohida saqlaydi (rejim).','Read the display options'=>'Koʻrsatish parametrlarini oʻqish','Returns the language switcher and credit display options.'=>'Tilni almashtirgich va kreditni ko‘rsatish parametrlarini qaytaradi.','Change the display options'=>'Koʻrsatish parametrlarini oʻzgartirish','Changes the switcher (style, flags, names, placement) and the credit line.'=>'O‘tkazgichni (stil, bayroqlar, nomlar, joylashuv) va mualliflik satrini o‘zgartiradi.','Read the DeepL usage'=>'DeepL foydalanishini oʻqish','Returns the characters used and the limit of the saved DeepL key this month.'=>'Ushbu oyda foydalanilgan belgilar va saqlangan DeepL kalitining limitini qaytaradi.','Read the engine settings'=>'Dvigatel sozlamalarini o\'qish','Returns the default and fallback engine, per-language engines, each engine\'s state and this month\'s spend.'=>'Standart va zaxira dvigatel, har bir til uchun dvigatellar, har bir dvigatelning holati va joriy oylik xarajatlarni qaytaradi.','Change the engine settings'=>'Dvigatel sozlamalarini o\'zgartirish','Sets the default engine, a fallback engine and per-language engines (default, fallback, per_lang). Per-language engines and fallback are Pro.'=>'Standart qidiruv tizimi, zaxira qidiruv tizimi va tillar bo\'yicha qidiruv tizimlarini (default, fallback, per_lang) o\'rnatadi. Tillar bo\'yicha qidiruv tizimlari va zaxira tizimi Pro darajasiga tegishli.','Save an engine key'=>'Dvigatel kalitini saqlash','Saves the API key (and region for Microsoft) of DeepL, Google or Microsoft; empty removes it. Keys are stored encrypted and never returned.'=>'DeepL, Google yoki Microsoft API kalitini (va Microsoft uchun mintaqani) saqlaydi; bo\'sh qoldirish uni o\'chirib tashlaydi. Kalitlar shifrlangan holda saqlanadi va hech qachon qaytarilmaydi.','Estimate a translation'=>'Tarjimani taxmin qilish','Estimates characters and cost to translate posts (posts or post_type) into languages (langs) with an engine, before spending anything.'=>'Hech qanday xarajat qilmasdan oldin, biron bir dvigatel yordamida postlarni (posts yoki post_type) tillarga (langs) tarjima qilish uchun belgilar soni va narxini taxmin qiladi.','Import a translated file (Pro)'=>'Tarjima qilingan faylni import qilish (Pro)','Uploads a Tranzly XLIFF or CSV file (content, filename) translated elsewhere; answers a token for tranzly/import-translation-file.'=>'Boshqa joyda tarjima qilingan Tranzly XLIFF yoki CSV faylini (kontent, fayl nomi) yuklaydi; tranzly/import-translation-file uchun token javobini beradi.','List plugins to migrate from (Pro)'=>'Ko‘chiriladigan plaginlarni ro‘yxatga olish (Pro)','Lists WPML, Polylang and TranslatePress data found on this site that can be imported.'=>'Ushbu saytdan import qilish mumkin bo\'lgan WPML, Polylang va TranslatePress ma\'lumotlari ro\'yxatini ko\'rsatadi.','Migrate from WPML, Polylang or TranslatePress (Pro)'=>'WPML, Polylang yoki TranslatePress (Pro) dan koʻchib oʻting','Imports the next page of translations from another multilingual plugin (mode: dry-run or run; cursor).'=>'Boshqa ko‘p tilli plagindan tarjimalarning keyingi sahifasini import qiladi (rejimi: sinov yoki bajarish; kursor).','Write an imported file (Pro)'=>'Import qilingan faylni yozish (Pro)','Writes the next page of posts from an uploaded translation file (repeat with after until done).'=>'Yuklangan tarjima faylidan postlarning keyingi sahifasini yozadi (tugaguncha after bilan takrorlang).','Read the integrations'=>'Integratsiyalarni o\'qish','Lists the SEO, WooCommerce, page-builder and form plugins Tranzly supports and which are active here.'=>'Tranzly qoʻllab-quvvatlaydigan va bu yerda faol boʻlgan SEO, WooCommerce, sahifa yaratuvchi va forma plaginlarini sanab oʻtadi.','List translation jobs'=>'Tarjima vazifalarini ro‘yxatga olish','Lists background translation jobs, newest first, with progress.'=>'Fon tarjima vazifalarini, eng yangisi birinchi bo\'lib, bajarilish jarayoni bilan birga ro\'yxatlaydi.','Start a translation job'=>'Tarjima ishini boshlash','Starts a background job translating listed posts (posts) or a whole post type into languages (langs).'=>'Kiritilgan postlarni (posts) yoki butun post turini tillarga (langs) tarjima qiluvchi fon jarayonini boshlaydi.','Retry or hand off a failed item'=>'Muvaffaqiyatsiz elementni qayta urinib ko\'ring yoki topshiring','Retries a failed item (action: retry, optionally with another engine) or marks it for translating by hand (action: by-hand).'=>'Muvaffaqiyatsiz elementni qayta urinadi (amal: retry, ixtiyoriy ravishda boshqa dvigatel bilan) yoki uni qo\'lda tarjima qilish uchun belgilaydi (amal: by-hand).','Read a job\'s progress'=>'Ish jarayonini o‘qish','Returns one job\'s progress and counts.'=>'Bitta vazifaning bajarilish jarayoni va sonini qaytaradi.','Cancel a job'=>'Topshiriqni bekor qilish','Stops a job; translations already made are kept.'=>'Jarayonni to\'xtatadi; allaqachon qilingan tarjimalar saqlanib qoladi.','Read a job\'s failures'=>'Ish xatolarini o\'qish','Lists a job\'s failed items with the reason for each.'=>'Har birining sababi bilan birga ishning bajarilmagan elementlarini ro\'yxatga kiritadi.','Read the licence'=>'Litsenziyani o\'qish','Returns this site\'s Tranzly plan, licence state, renewal date and what the plan includes.'=>'Bu saytning Tranzly rejimini, litsenziya holatini, yangilanish sanasini va reja nimalarni o\'z ichiga olishini qaytaradi.','Revoke temporary support logins'=>'Vaqtinchalik qo‘llab-quvvatlash loginlarini bekor qilish','Removes temporary support users now (ids).'=>'Vaqtinchalik qo\'llab-quvvatlash foydalanuvchilarini hozir o\'chiradi (idlar).','List temporary support logins'=>'Vaqtinchalik qo‘llab-quvvatlash uchun kirishlarni ro‘yxatga olish','Lists the temporary support users granted to our team and when each expires.'=>'Bizning jamoamizga berilgan vaqtinchalik qo\'llab-quvvatlash foydalanuvchilarini va ularning har biri qachon tugashini sanab o\'tadi.','Disconnect from support'=>'Qo\'llab-quvvatlash xizmatidan uzilish','Disconnects this site from support.'=>'Bu saytni qo\'llab-quvvatlash xizmatidan uzadi.','Read the support connection'=>'Qo\'llab-quvvatlash ulanishini o\'qish','Says whether this site is connected to Zinn Digital® support, and as whom.'=>'Bu sayt Zinn Digital® qo\'llab-quvvatlash xizmatiga ulanganmi yoki yo\'qmi va kim sifatida ulanganini bildiradi.','Connect to support'=>'Qo‘llab-quvvatlash xizmatiga ulanish','Connects this site to Zinn Digital® support (name, email, consent).'=>'Ushbu saytni Zinn Digital® qo‘llab-quvvatlash xizmatiga ulaydi (ism, elektron pochta, rozilik).','Consent to support diagnostics'=>'Qo‘llab-quvvatlash diagnostikasiga rozilik berish','Records the administrator\'s consent to send diagnostics with support tickets.'=>'Qo‘llab-quvvatlash so‘rovlari bilan diagnostika ma\'lumotlarini yuborish uchun administratorning roziligini yozib oladi.','Read the site diagnostics'=>'Sayt diagnostikasini o\'qish','Returns the diagnostics a support ticket would carry: versions, active plugins, limits and recent errors.'=>'Qo\'llab-quvvatlash chiptasi o\'z ichiga oladigan diagnostika ma\'lumotlarini qaytaradi: versiyalar, faol plaginlar, cheklovlar va so\'nggi xatolar.','Open a support ticket'=>'Qo‘llab-quvvatlash xizmatiga murojaat ochish','Files a support ticket (subject, message, kind, email) with this site\'s diagnostics; access_days and credentials optionally grant our team temporary access.'=>'Ushbu sayt diagnostikasi bilan qo‘llab-quvvatlash so‘rovini (mavzu, xabar, tur, elektron pochta) yaratadi; access_days va ma\'lumotlar jamoamizga vaqtincha kirish huquqini ixtiyoriy ravishda taqdim etadi.','Start the free Pro trial'=>'Bepul Pro sinov muddatini boshlash','Starts the 14-day Tranzly Pro trial for this site (no payment needed).'=>'Ushbu sayt uchun Tranzly Pro 14 kunlik sinov muddatini boshlaydi (to\'lov talab etilmaydi).','Read the Tranzly 2.x import'=>'Tranzly 2.x importini o\'qish','Returns the state and report of importing translations from Tranzly 2.x.'=>'Tranzly 2.x\'dan tarjimalarni import qilish holati va hisobotini qaytaradi.','Import Tranzly 2.x translations'=>'Tranzly 2.x tarjimalarini import qilish','Runs the 2.x import: dry-run (report only), run, or undo.'=>'2.x import jarayonini bajaradi: sinov tarzida bajarish (faqat hisobot), bajarish yoki bekor qilish.','Translate an image\'s text'=>'Rasm matnini tarjima qilish','Saves an image\'s alt text, title or caption (field) in a language (lang).'=>'Rasmdagi alt matn, sarlavha yoki sarlavhani (maydon) tilda (lang) saqlaydi.','Read the menus per language'=>'Har bir til uchun menyularni o\'qing','Returns which menu each language shows in each menu location.'=>'Har bir til har bir menyu joylashuvida qaysi menyuni ko\'rsatishini qaytaradi.','Set the menus per language'=>'Har bir til uchun menyularni sozlang','Assigns a menu per language per location (map).'=>'Har bir til va joylashuv (xarita) uchun alohida menyu tayinlaydi.','Protect or unlock a translation'=>'Tarjimani himoya qilish yoki qulfdan chiqarish','Protects a translation from being overwritten by the engine (protected: true), or unlocks it.'=>'Tarjimaning mexanik tomonidan qayta yozilishidan himoya qiladi (protected: true) yoki qulfdan chiqaradi.','Read a quality report (Pro)'=>'Sifat hisobotini o‘qish (Pro)','Returns a translation\'s AI quality report: score and the segments it flagged.'=>'Sun\'iy intellekt tarjima sifatini baholash hisobotini qaytaradi: baho va u belgilagan segmentlar.','Approve or reject a translation (Pro)'=>'Tarjimani tasdiqlang yoki rad eting (Pro)','Approves a translation (and publishes it when the original is published) or sends it back (decision, note).'=>'Tarjimani tasdiqlaydi (va asl nusxasi e\'lon qilinganda uni ham e\'lon qiladi) yoki uni qaytarib yuboradi (qaror, izoh).','Read a translation side by side'=>'Tarjimani yonma-yon o\'qing','Returns a translation\'s segments beside the original\'s, for review and correction.'=>'Ko\'rib chiqish va tuzatish uchun tarjima segmentlarini asl nusxa yonida qaytaradi.','Correct a translation'=>'Tarjimani to\'g\'rilash','Saves corrected segments of a translation (segments: key to text); corrected text is protected from re-translation.'=>'Tarjimaning toʻgʻrilangan segmentlarini saqlaydi (segmentlar: matn kaliti); toʻgʻrilangan matn qayta tarjima qilishdan himoyalanadi.','Unlink a post from its translations'=>'Maqolani uning tarjimalaridan ajratish','Takes a post out of its translation group; it keeps its language.'=>'Postni tarjima guruhidan chiqarib tashlaydi; uning tili saqlanib qoladi.','Read a post\'s translations'=>'Maqola tarjimalarini o\'qish','Lists a post\'s translation group: every language\'s member with its title, status and edit link.'=>'Maqolaning tarjima guruhini ro\'yxatga oladi: har bir tilning a\'zosi o\'z sarlavhasi, holati va tahrirlash havolasi bilan.','Create an empty translation'=>'Bo\'sh tarjima yaratish','Creates a draft translation of a post in a language (lang) to write by hand, without an engine.'=>'Dvigatelersiz, qo\'lda yozish uchun postning tilidagi (lang) qoralama tarjimasini yaratadi.','Link an existing post as a translation'=>'Mavjud postni tarjima sifatida ulash','Makes an existing post (target) the translation of this post in a language.'=>'Mavjud xabarni (maqsad) boshqa tildagi ushbu xabarning tarjimasiga aylantiradi.','Check translations with AI (Pro)'=>'AI yordamida tarjimalarni tekshirish (Pro)','Schedules the AI quality check of the next page of a language\'s translations (or the given posts).'=>'Til tarjimasining keyingi sahifasi (yoki berilgan xabarlar) uchun sun\'iy intellekt sifatini tekshirishni rejalashtiradi.','Multilingual SEO audit (Pro)'=>'Ko\'p tilli SEO audit (Pro)','Checks translations for missing SEO titles, descriptions, slugs and hreflang in a language, page by page.'=>'Tarjimalarda yetishmayotgan SEO sarlavhalari, tavsiflari, slug va hreflang\'ni har bir sahifa bo\'yicha tekshiradi.','Change languages and settings'=>'Til va sozlamalarni o‘zgartirish','Sets the site\'s languages (languages: list of code and name; the first is the original language), the front-end class prefix, and whether AI agents (MCP) are allowed.'=>'Sayt tillarini (tillar: kod va nom ro\'yxati; birinchisi asl til), interfeys sinfi prefiksini va sun\'iy intellekt agentlariga (MCP) ruxsat berilganligini o\'rnatadi.','Read theme and plugin texts'=>'Mavzu va plagin matnlarini o\'qish','Returns the theme and plugin texts (scope) in a language with their translations.'=>'Mavzu va plagin matnlarini (domenini) ularning tarjimalari bilan birgalikda tegishli tilda qaytaradi.','Translate missing theme and plugin texts'=>'Yetishmayotgan mavzu va plagin matnlarini tarjima qilish','Translates the next page of untranslated theme and plugin texts in a language with the default engine (repeat with after until done).'=>'Standart dvigatel yordamida tilga tarjima qilinmagan mavzu va plagin matnlarining keyingi sahifasini tarjima qiladi (tugaguncha „after“ bilan takrorlang).','Correct theme and plugin texts'=>'Mavzu va plagin matnlarini to\'g\'rilash','Saves corrected translations of theme and plugin texts (strings); they become protected.'=>'Mavzu va plagin matnlari (satrlar) ning to\'g\'irlangan tarjima saqlanadi; ular himoyalangan hisoblanadi.','Translate what is missing'=>'Yetishmayotgan qismni tarjima qilish','Queues translation of every missing (or out-of-date) item in a language and post type.'=>'Til va post turidagi har bir yetishmayotgan (yoki eskirgan) element tarjimasini navbatga qo‘yadi.','List what is missing or out of date'=>'Yetishmayotgan yoki eskirgan narsalarni sanab o\'ting','Lists originals with their translation state in a language (state: missing, stale, current), page by page.'=>'Sahifama-sahifa, tildagi asl nusxalarni ularning tarjima holati (holati: yetishmayotgan, eskirgan, joriy) bilan birga ro‘yxatlaydi.','Read the site\'s texts in a language'=>'Sayt matnlarini tilda o\'qish','Returns the site title, tagline and widget texts in a language.'=>'Sayt sarlavhasi, shior va vidjet matnlarini tilda qaytaradi.','Translate a site text'=>'Sayt matnini tarjima qilish','Saves one site text (key) in a language, e.g. the site title or tagline.'=>'Bir sayt matnini (kalitini) bitta tilda, masalan, sayt sarlavhasi yoki shiorini saqlaydi.','Translate a category or tag'=>'Kategoriya yoki tegni tarjima qilish','Translates one term (category, tag or product attribute) into a language (lang) with an engine, creating or updating its translation.'=>'Bitta atamani (kategoriya, teg yoki mahsulot atributini) tarjima mexanizmi yordamida tilga (lang) tarjima qiladi, uning tarjimasini yaratadi yoki yangilaydi.','Unlink a term from its translations'=>'Atamani uning tarjimalaridan uzish','Takes a term out of its translation group.'=>'Atamani o\'z tarjima guruhidan chiqaradi.','Read a term\'s translations'=>'Term tarjimalarini oʻqish','Lists a category\'s or tag\'s translation group.'=>'Kategoriya yoki teg tarjima guruhini roʻyxatga oladi.','Create a term translation by hand'=>'Qo\'lda atama tarjimasini yaratish','Creates a term\'s translation in a language with a name, slug and description you give.'=>'Siz bergan nom, slug va tavsifga ega tilda atamaning tarjimasini yaratadi.','Link an existing term as a translation'=>'Mavjud atamani tarjima sifatida bog‘lash','Makes an existing term (target) the translation of this term in a language.'=>'Mavjud atamani (maqsad) tildagi ushbu atamaning tarjimasiga aylantiradi.','List theme and plugin text sources (Pro)'=>'Mavzu va plagin matn manbalarini ro‘yxatga olish (Pro)','Lists the themes and plugins whose texts can be scanned for translation, and how many strings each has.'=>'Tarjima qilinishi kerak bo\'lgan matnlar skanerlanishi mumkin bo\'lgan mavzular va plaginlarni hamda ularning har birida qancha qator borligini ro\'yxatlaydi.','Scan a theme or plugin for texts (Pro)'=>'Mavzu yoki plaginni matnlar uchun skanerlash (Pro)','Scans the next page of a component\'s PHP files for translatable texts (repeat with after until done).'=>'Komponentning PHP fayllarining keyingi sahifasini tarjima qilinadigan matnlar uchun skanerlaydi (tugaguncha keyingisi bilan takrorlang).','Read the address settings'=>'Manzil sozlamalarini o\'qish','Returns how languages appear in addresses (folder, subdomain or domain), translated slugs and bases, and noindex for untranslated pages.'=>'Tillar manzillarda (papka, subdomen yoki domen) qanday ko‘rinishini, tarjima qilingan slug va bazalarni hamda tarjima qilinmagan sahifalar uchun noindex qiymatini qaytaradi.','Change the address settings'=>'Manzil sozlamalarini o\'zgartirish','Sets the address mode (mode), per-language domains, translated bases and segments, noindex_untranslated and slug suggestions.'=>'Manzil rejimini (mode), til boʻyicha domenlarni, tarjima qilingan asoslar va segmentlarni, noindex_untranslated hamda slug tavsiyalarini oʻrnatadi.','Estimate translating the site (Pro)'=>'Saytni tarjima qilishni baholash (Pro)','Estimates a whole-site translation in a language (post_types, scope, engine) before starting it.'=>'Ishni boshlashdan oldin tildagi butun sayt tarjimasini taxmin qiladi (post_types, scope, engine).','Read the workflow settings (Pro)'=>'Ish jarayoni sozlamalarini o‘qish (Pro)','Returns auto-translation on publish and on update, review before publish, and the AI quality check\'s threshold, provider and model.'=>'Nashr qilishda va yangilashda avtomatik tarjimani, nashr qilishdan oldin ko‘rib chiqishni hamda sun’iy intellekt sifatini tekshirish chegarasi, provayderi va modelini qaytaradi.','Change the workflow settings (Pro)'=>'Ish jarayoni sozlamalarini oʻzgartirish (Pro)','Sets on_update (off, stale, translate), on_publish, review, quality_threshold, quality_provider and quality_model.'=>'on_update (off, stale, translate), on_publish, review, quality_threshold, quality_provider va quality_model parametrlarini sozlaydi.','Translate the whole site'=>'Butun saytni tarjima qilish','Starts background translation jobs for every original of the given content types (all translated types when none are given): the missing translations, the out-of-date ones, or all of them. Returns the jobs started, one per language.'=>'Berilgan kontent turlarining har bir asl nusxasi uchun fon tarjima vazifalarini boshlaydi (hech qanday tur ko\'rsatilmagan bo\'lsa, barcha tarjima qilingan turlar uchun): yetishmayotgan tarjimalar, eskirganlari yoki ularning barchasi. Boshlangan vazifalarni, har bir til uchun bittadan qaytaradi.','Check a translation with AI'=>'Sun\'iy intellekt yordamida tarjimani tekshirish','Has AI compare one translation with its original and score it, and stores the report on the translation. Uses the quality-check AI model set in Tranzly\'s workflow settings.'=>'Sun\'iy intellektga tarjimani uning asl nusxasi bilan solishtirish va baholash, shuningdek, tarjima bo\'yicha hisobotni saqlash imkonini beradi. Tranzly ish jarayoni sozlamalarida o\'rnatilgan sifatni tekshirish sun\'iy intellekt modelidan foydalanadi.','The translation\'s post ID (see tranzly/translation-status).'=>'Tarjimaning post ID raqami (tranzly/translation-status\'ga qarang).','Export a file for human translators'=>'Inson tarjimonlar uchun faylni eksport qilish','Returns an XLIFF or CSV file (as text) with the originals and their translations in one language, for a translator or a translation agency: the given posts, or a page of up to 100 originals of a content type in a state (missing, stale, translated or all; repeat with after). Import it back with tranzly/upload-translation-file.'=>'Tarjimon yoki tarjima agentligi uchun asl nusxalar va ularning bitta tildagi tarjimalari keltirilgan XLIFF yoki CSV faylini (matn ko\'rinishida) qaytaradi: berilgan xabarlar yoki ma\'lum holatdagi kontent turining 100 tagacha asl nusxadan iborat sahifasi (yo\'qolgan, eskirgan, tarjima qilingan yoki barchasi; "after" yordamida takrorlang). Uni tranzly/upload-translation-file yordamida qayta import qiling.','Words never translated (brand and product names).'=>'Hech qachon tarjima qilinmaydigan so\'zlar (brend va mahsulot nomlari).','Per language code: source term => the translation always used.'=>'Til kodi bo\'yicha: manba atamasi => doim ishlatiladigan tarjima.','Per language code: formality (default, more, less) and style instructions.'=>'Til kodi bo\'yicha: rasmiylik (standart, ko\'proq, kamroq) va uslub bo\'yicha ko\'rsatmalar.','Read the glossary'=>'Lug\'atni o\'qish','Returns the words never translated, the fixed term translations and the tone per language.'=>'Hech qachon tarjima qilinmaydigan so\'zlarni, belgilangan atamalar tarjimasini va har bir til uchun ohangni qaytaradi.','Update the glossary'=>'Glossariyni yangilash','Replaces the parts of the glossary you send (words never translated, term translations, tone); parts you leave out are kept. Used by every engine from the next translation on.'=>'Siz yuborgan lug\'at qismlarini almashtiradi (hech qachon tarjima qilinmaydigan so\'zlar, atamalar tarjimasi, ohang); qoldirib ketgan qismlaringiz saqlab qolinadi. Keyingi tarjimadan boshlab har bir mexanizm tomonidan ishlatiladi.','Language suggestion'=>'Til taklifi','This page is also available in %s.'=>'Bu sahifa shuningdek %s tilida ham mavjud.','Read it in %s'=>'%s da oʻqish','No thanks'=>'Yo‘q, rahmat','Choose how languages appear in your addresses: a folder, a subdomain, a separate domain or a query parameter.'=>'Tillarning manzillaringizda qanday ko‘rinishini tanlang: papka, subdomen, alohida domen yoki so‘rov parametri.','Subdomains and separate domains per language are part of Tranzly Pro.'=>'Har bir til uchun subdomain va alohida domenlar Tranzly Pro tarkibiga kiradi.','The language folders must be a list.'=>'Til papkalari ro\'yxat bo\'lishi kerak.','"%s" cannot be a language folder. Use 2 to 12 lowercase letters, digits or hyphens, different for every language, and not a word WordPress already uses.'=>'"%s" til papkasi bo‘lishi mumkin emas. Har bir til uchun har xil bo‘lgan hamda WordPress allaqachon ishlatmaydigan 2 dan 12 gacha kichik harflar, raqamlar yoki defislardan foydalaning.','The domains must be a list.'=>'Domenlar roʻyxat boʻlishi kerak.','"%s" is not a domain name, such as example.de.'=>'"%s" domen nomi emas, masalan, example.de kabi.','Each language needs its own domain.'=>'Har bir til o\'z domeniga ega bo\'lishi kerak.','The translated address words must be a list.'=>'Tarjima qilingan manzil so\'zlari ro\'yxat bo\'lishi kerak.','The translated address words must be listed per language.'=>'Tarjima qilingan manzil so\'zlari har bir til bo\'yicha ko\'rsatilishi kerak.','"%s" cannot be used in an address. Use lowercase letters, digits and hyphens.'=>'"%s" manzil uchun ishlatilishi mumkin emas. Kichik harflar, raqamlar va defislardan foydalaning.','This setting is on or off.'=>'Bu sozlama yoqilgan yoki oʻchirilgan.','Hiding untranslated pages from search engines is part of Tranzly Pro.'=>'Qidiruv tizimlaridan tarjima qilinmagan sahifalarni yashirish Tranzly Pro tarkibiga kiradi.','Languages (as a submenu)'=>'Tillar','Languages (side by side)'=>'Tillar (yonma-yon)','Add to Menu'=>'Menuga qoʻshish','On your site, this item shows the site\'s languages, each linking to the current page in that language.'=>'Saytingizda bu element sayt tillarini ko‘rsatadi, ularning har biri joriy sahifaga shu tilda havola beradi.','%1$s (%2$d)'=>'%1$s (%2$d)','Links to this page in each of your languages.'=>'Har bir tilingizdagi ushbu sahifaga havolalar.','Language name'=>'Til nomi','Language code'=>'Til kodi','Name and code'=>'Nomi va kodi','Design'=>'Dizayn','Show each language as'=>'Har bir tilni quyidagicha ko\'rsatish:','Show flags (a flag is a country, not a language)'=>'Bayroqlarni ko\'rsatish (bayroq tilni emas, mamlakatni bildiradi)','List'=>'Ro\'yxat','Pills'=>'Tugmalar','Buttons'=>'Tugmalar','Dropdown'=>'Ochiladigan menyu','Language codes'=>'Til kodlari','Flags'=>'Bayroqchalar','Include the current language'=>'Joriy tilni kiritish','Hide languages this page is not translated into'=>'Ushbu sahifa tarjima qilinmagan tillarni yashirish','Stack vertically'=>'Vertikal ravishda joylashtirish','Accessible label'=>'Ochiq yorliq','Text'=>'Matn','Background'=>'Fon','Current language text'=>'Joriy til matni','Current language background'=>'Joriy til muhiti','Border'=>'Chegara','Corner radius'=>'Burchak radiusi','Space between languages'=>'Tillклар orasidagi bo\'shliq','Text size'=>'Matn o\'lchami','Switcher'=>'Almashtirgich','(no title)'=>'(sarlavhasiz)','There is nothing to fix here.'=>'Bu yerda tuzatiladigan hech narsa yo\'q.','No content type is translated on this site.'=>'Bu saytda hech qanday kontent turi tarjima qilinmaydi.','That content type is not translated on this site.'=>'Ushbu kontent turi ushbu saytda tarjima qilinmagan.','There is nothing to translate in that selection.'=>'Ushbu tanlovda tarjima qilinadigan narsa yo\'q.','Choose at least one language to translate into.'=>'Tarjima qilish uchun kamida bitta tilni tanlang.','You are not allowed to export translations.'=>'Tarjimalarni eksport qilishga ruxsat berilmagan.','Choose an XLIFF or CSV file to import.'=>'Import qilish uchun XLIFF yoki CSV faylini tanlang.','That is not a Tranzly XLIFF or CSV file. Export one first, translate it, and import it here.'=>'Bu Tranzly XLIFF yoki CSV fayli emas. Avval birini eksport qiling, uni tarjima qiling va bu yerga import qiling.','The file could not be stored for importing. Check that the uploads folder is writable.'=>'Faylni import qilish uchun saqlab bo\'lmadi. Yuklashlar papkasiga yozish mumkinligini tekshiring.','That import is not there any more. Upload the file again.'=>'Bu import endi mavjud emas. Faylni qaytadan yuklang.','That page is not on this site any more.'=>'Bu sahifa endi ushbu saytda mavjud emas.','The file is for a language this site does not have.'=>'Fayl ushbu saytda mavjud bo\'lmagan til uchun mo\'ljallangan.','Could not link %1$s %2$d: %3$s'=>'%1$s %2$d ni bog‘lab bo‘lmadi: %3$s','Post #%1$d: %2$s'=>'%1$d-xabar: %2$s','No data from that plugin was found on this site.'=>'Bu plagindan hech qanday maʼlumot ushbu saytdan topilmadi.','This is not a translation of anything on this site.'=>'Bu saytdagi hech narsaning tarjimasi emas.','There is no text to check.'=>'Tekshiriladigan matn mavjud emas.','The AI settings are not part of this build.'=>'AI sozlamalari ushbu tuzilmaga kirmaydi.','The AI provider did not answer.'=>'AI provayderi javob bermadi.','The AI model did not score every part of this page. Try again, or choose another model.'=>'Sun\'iy intellekt modeli bu sahitaning har bir qismini baholamadi. Qaytadan urinib ko\'ring yoki boshqa modelni tanlang.','Translator'=>'Tarjimon','Translation reviewer'=>'Tarjima tekshiruvchisi','A reviewer asked for changes to this translation.'=>'Taqrizchi ushbu tarjimaga oʻzgartirishlar kiritishni soʻradi.','A reviewer asked for changes to this translation: %s'=>'Taqrizchi ushbu tarjimaga oʻzgartirishlar kiritishni soʻradi: %s','This translation is waiting for a reviewer. Publishing it (as a reviewer) approves it.'=>'Bu tarjima taqrizchini kutmoqda. Uni nashr etish (taqrizchi sifatida) uni tasdiqlaydi.','Only a translation can be reviewed.'=>'Faqat tarjimani ko‘rib chiqish mumkin.','Choose what happens when an original changes: nothing, mark its translations out of date, or translate them again.'=>'Asl nusxa o\'zgarganda nima sodir bo\'lishini tanlang: hech narsa qilinmasin, uning tarjimalari eskirgan deb belgilansin yoki ular qaytadan tarjima qilinsin.','The quality threshold is a score from 0 to 100.'=>'Sifat chegarasi 0 dan 100 gacha bo\'lgan balladir.','Show hidden suggestions on the Overview again'=>'Umumiy ko‘rinishda yashirin takliflarni qaytadan ko‘rsatish','All'=>'Barchasi','%d selected'=>'%d ta tanlandi' . "\0" . '%d ta tanlandi','Nothing matches.'=>'Hech narsa mos kelmadi.','Select all on this page'=>'Ushbu sahifadagi barchasini tanlash','Select'=>'Tanlash','Pages'=>'Sahifalar','Previous'=>'Oldingi','Page %1$d of %2$d'=>'%1$d-sahifa (%2$d tadan)','Set up %s in a few minutes'=>'Bir necha daqiqada %s ni sozlang','Start setup'=>'O‘rnatishni boshlash','This site'=>'Ushbu sayt','Edition'=>'Nashr','Sites on this licence'=>'Ushbu litsenziyadagi saytlar','Version'=>'Versiya','This looks like a staging or local copy, so it does not use up a site on your licence.'=>'Bu test yoki lokal nusxaga o‘xshaydi, shuning uchun u litsenziyangizdagi veb-sayt o‘rnini band qilmaydi.','See what Pro adds'=>'Pro nima qo\'shishini ko\'ring','Go to'=>'O\'tish','Personal'=>'Shaxsiy','Business'=>'Biznes','Agency'=>'Agentlik','Any number of sites'=>'Istalgancha saytlar','Unlimited sites'=>'Cheksiz saytlar','%d site'=>'%d ta sayt' . "\0" . '%d ta sayt','Pro'=>'Pro','%s trial'=>'%s sinov muddati','Your trial has started. Reload the page to see every Pro feature.'=>'Sinov muddatingiz boshlandi. Pro funksiyalarning barchasini ko\'rish uchun sahifani qayta yuklang.','The trial could not be started.'=>'Sinov muddatini boshlab bo\'lmadi.','Feature'=>'Funksiya','Included'=>'Kiritilgan','Not included'=>'Kiritilmagan','Your licence'=>'Sizning litsenziyangiz','%1$d of %2$d in use'=>'%2$d tadan %1$d tasi ishlatilmoqda','Renews'=>'Yangilanadi','Staging, test and localhost copies of a site are free and never count toward your site limit.'=>'Saytning steyjing, test va lokalhost nusxalari bepul bo\'lib, ular hech qachon sayt limiti hisobiga kirmaydi.','Your plan includes priority support.'=>'Sizning rejangiz ustuvor yordamni o\'z ichiga oladi.','Manage your licence and billing'=>'Litsenziyangiz va hisob-kitobingizni boshqaring','Get more with Pro'=>'Pro bilan ko\'proq oling','Start a free %d-day trial, no card needed'=>'%d kunlik bepul sinov muddatini boshlang, karta talab qilinmaydi' . "\0" . '%d kunlik bepul sinov muddatini boshlang, karta talab qilinmaydi','See plans and prices'=>'Reja va narxlarni ko\'rish','Use Tranzly and Page Builder Sandwich together? The bundle includes both Pro plugins for less.'=>'Tranzly va Page Builder Sandwich’ni birgalikda ishlatmoqchimisiz? To‘plam ikkala Pro plaginni ham arzonroq narxda o‘z ichiga oladi.','Your licence has expired. Renew it to keep getting updates and Pro features.'=>'Litsenziyangiz muddati tugadi. Yangilanishlar va Pro funksiyalaridan foydalanishda davom etish uchun uni yangilang.','Renew now'=>'Hozir yangilash','Compare the plans'=>'Rejalarni solishtirish','Search features'=>'Xususiyatlarni qidirish','Area'=>'Hudud','Included in'=>'Quyidagiga kiritilgan','No feature matches.'=>'Mos keladigan funksiya yo\'q.','Features by plan'=>'Rejalar bo‘yicha funksiyalar','Hide'=>'Yashirish','Activate it on the Plugins screen'=>'Plaginlar ekranida uni faollashtiring','Install it'=>'Uni o\'rnatish','Overview'=>'Umumiy koʻrinish','Setup'=>'O‘rnatish','Plans and licence'=>'Rejalar va litsenziya','Add-ons'=>'Qo\'shimchalar','Get help'=>'Yordam olish','Feedback'=>'Fikr-mulohaza','Your choice could not be saved.'=>'Tanlovingiz saqlanmadi.','The setup state could not be saved.'=>'Oʻrnatish holatini saqlab boʻlmadi.','Match my computer'=>'Kompyuterim bilan moslashtirish','Light'=>'Yorug‘','Dark'=>'To\'q rang','Colour scheme'=>'Ranglar sxemasi','Help'=>'Yordam','Guide to this screen'=>'Ushbu ekran boʻyicha qoʻllanma','Take the tour'=>'Ekskursiyadan o‘tish','Get help or report a bug'=>'Yordam oling yoki xato haqida xabar bering','Plugin screens'=>'Plagin ekranlari','That could not be saved.'=>'Buni saqlab bo‘lmadi.','Before you contact support'=>'Qo‘llab-quvvatlash xizmatiga murojaat qilishdan oldin','Your request is sent from this site to %s, who make this plugin. We send:'=>'So\'rovingiz ushbu saytdan ushbu plaginni yaratgan %s ga yuborildi. Biz quyidagilarni yuboramiz:','your e-mail address and name, so we can reply;'=>'javob berishimiz uchun elektron pochta manzilingiz va ismingiz;','the subject and message you write;'=>'siz yozgan mavzu va xabar;','your licence ID, so paying customers get priority;'=>'litsenziya ID raqamingiz, shunda pullik mijozlar ustuvorlik oladi;','only if you tick it: site details (WordPress and PHP versions, theme, plugins, an excerpt of the error log with passwords and e-mail addresses removed), which you can read before sending;'=>'faqat belgilaganingizdagina: sayt tafsilotlari (WordPress va PHP versiyalari, tema, plaginlar, parollar va elektron pochta manzillari olib tashlangan xatolar jurnali parchasi), ularni yuborishdan oldin o‘qib chiqishingiz mumkin;','only if you add them: logins for your site, stored encrypted and deleted 30 days after your request is closed.'=>'faqat siz ularni qo‘shsangiz: saytingiz uchun loginlar, shifrlangan holda saqlanadi va so‘rovingiz yopilgandan keyin 30 kun o‘tgach o‘chiriladi.','Privacy policy'=>'Maxfiylik siyosati','I agree, continue'=>'Men roziiman, davom etish','The connection could not be checked.'=>'Ulanishni tekshirib boʻlmadi.','That did not work. Try again.'=>'Bu ishlamadi. Qayta urinib ko\'ring.','Zinn Digital® support disconnected this site.'=>'Zinn Digital® yordam xizmati ushbu saytni uzib qo\'ydi.','Zinn Digital® support no longer recognises this site.'=>'Zinn Digital® qo‘llab-quvvatlash xizmati ushbu saytni endi tanimaydi.','You disconnected this site.'=>'Siz bu saytni uzdingiz.','Connect this site to support'=>'Ushbu saytni qo‘llab-quvvatlash xizmatiga ulang','Connected. Replies go to %s.'=>'Ulandi. Javoblar %s manziliga yuboriladi.','Not connected. You can still send a request with your e-mail address below; connecting saves typing it each time.'=>'Ulanmagan. Quyida elektron pochta manzilingiz bilan soʻrov yuborishingiz mumkin; ulanish uni har safar kiritishdan ozod qiladi.','E-mail address'=>'Elektron pochta manzili','Your name (optional)'=>'Ismingiz (ixtiyoriy)','I agree to connect this site to Zinn Digital® support. It sends this site’s address, WordPress and PHP versions and the plugin version, and can be disconnected at any time from here or by Zinn Digital®.'=>'Men ushbu saytni Zinn Digital® qo‘llab-quvvatlash xizmatiga ulashga roziman. Bu sayt manzilini, WordPress va PHP versiyalarini hamda plagin versiyasini yuboradi va uni istalgan vaqtda shu yerdan yoki Zinn Digital® orqali uzib qo‘yish mumkin.','Connect'=>'Ulanish','I need help'=>'Yordam kerak','Report a bug'=>'Xatolik haqida xabar berish','Send feedback'=>'Fikr-mulohaza yuborish','Request a feature'=>'Funksiyani so\'rash','The site details could not be read.'=>'Sayt tafsilotlarini o\'qib bo\'lmadi.','Your request could not be sent. Try again in a few minutes.'=>'So‘rovingizni yuborib bo‘lmadi. Bir necha daqiqadan so‘ng yana urinib ko‘ring.','WordPress admin'=>'WordPress administratori','File manager'=>'Fayl menejeri','cPanel'=>'cPanel','FTP / SFTP'=>'FTP / SFTP','Feedback and feature requests'=>'Fikr-mulohazalar va funksiya so‘rovlari','Sent. Your reference is %s, and our reply will come by e-mail.'=>'Yuborildi. Sizning ma\'lumotnomangiz %s va bizning javobimiz elektron pochta orqali keladi.','What is it about?'=>'Bu nima haqida?','Reply to (e-mail)'=>'(Elektron pochtaga) javob berish','Subject'=>'Mavzu','What did you do, what did you expect, and what happened instead?'=>'Siz nima qildingiz, nimani kutgan edingiz va uning o‘rniga nima sodir bo‘ldi?','Include site details (versions, theme, plugins, error log excerpt)'=>'Sayt tafsilotlarini kiritish (versiyalar, tema, plaginlar, xatoliklar jurnali parchasi)','See exactly what is sent'=>'Nima yuborilganini aniq ko\'ring','Loading…'=>'Yuklanmoqda…','Logins for support (optional, stored encrypted)'=>'Qo\'llab-quvvatlash uchun kirish ma\'lumotlari (ixtiyoriy, shifrlangan holda saqlanadi)','A login is only sent with its password. Leave a row out rather than half-filled.'=>'Kirish faqat paroli bilan birga yuboriladi. Qatorni chala toʻldirgandan koʻra, uni umuman qoldirmang.','Login address'=>'Kirish manzili','Username'=>'Foydalanuvchi nomi','Password'=>'Parol','Add a login'=>'Kirish qo\'shish','Create a temporary support login'=>'Vaqtincha qo\'llab-quvvatlash loginini yaratish','A separate user for our support team, without access to users, plugins installation or code editing. It is deleted automatically when it expires, or whenever you revoke it below.'=>'Foydalanuvchilarga, plaginlarni o‘rnatishga yoki kodni tahrirlashga ruxsatsiz, yordam guruhimiz uchun alohida foydalanuvchi. U muddati tugaganda yoki uni quyida bekor qilganingizda avtomatik ravishda o‘chiriladi.','Yes, for %d day'=>'Ha, %d kun davomida' . "\0" . 'Ha, %d kun davomida','Send'=>'Yuborish','The list could not be loaded.'=>'Roʻyxatni yuklab boʻlmadi.','That login could not be removed.'=>'Ushbu kirish ma\'lumotlarini o\'chirib bo\'lmadi.','Temporary support logins'=>'Vaqtinchalik qo‘llab-quvvatlash uchun kirishlar','None. Support can only log in to this site if you create a login here.'=>'Hech qanday. Qo‘llab-quvvatlash xizmati bu yerda kirish ma’lumotlarini yaratmasangiz, ushbu saytga kira olmaydi.','expired, being removed'=>'muddati o\'tgan, o\'chirilmoqda','expires %s'=>'%s muddati tugaydi','Revoke now'=>'Darhol bekor qilish','Step %1$d of %2$d'=>'%2$d-qadamdan %1$d-qadam','Close the tour'=>'Ekskursiyani yopish','Back'=>'Orqaga','Everything in one place'=>'Barchasi bir joyda','These tabs lead to every screen of the plugin: setup, settings, your licence, help and more.'=>'Bu tablar plaginning har bir ekraniga olib boradi: o\'rnatish, sozlamalar, litsenziyangiz, yordam va boshqalar.','Help on every screen'=>'Har bir ekranda yordam','Open this menu for the guide to the screen you are on, this tour, or to ask us for help.'=>'Hozir turgan ekranning qo‘llanmasi, ushbu tanishtiruv yoki bizdan yordam so‘rash uchun ushbu menyuni oching.','Light or dark'=>'Yorug\' yoki qorong\'i','Choose light, dark, or the same as your computer. Your choice is remembered for you only.'=>'Yorug\', qorong\'i ёki kompyuteringiz bilan bir xil rejimni tanlang. Tanlovingiz faqat siz uchun eslab qolinadi.','Welcome'=>'Xush kelibsiz','This short tour shows where things are. You can leave it at any time with Escape.'=>'Bu qisqa tanishtiruv qayerda nima borligini ko\'rsatadi. Uni istalgan vaqtda Escape tugmasi yordamida tark etishingiz mumkin.','Your site at a glance'=>'Saytingiz bir qarashda','Setup progress and your plan are shown here, with the next thing worth doing.'=>'Oʻrnatish jarayoni va kuningiz rejasi bu yerda keyingi bajarilishi lozim boʻlgan muhim ish bilan birga koʻrsatilgan.','Your plan, how many sites it covers, and whether this copy of the site counts toward that limit.'=>'Sizning rejangiz, u nechta saytni qamrab olishi va ushbu sayt nusxasi shu limitga kirish yoki kirmasligi.','Try Pro or upgrade'=>'Pro versiyasini sinab ko\'ring yoki yangilang','Start a free trial without a card, upgrade, or renew, all from here.'=>'Karta talab qilinmaydigan bepul sinov muddatini boshlang, uni yangilang yoki uzaytiring — hammasi shu yerda.','Every feature and the plan that includes it. Search for a feature or show one area at a time.'=>'Har bir funksiya va uni o\'z ichiga olgan reja. Funksiyani qidiring yoki bir vaqtning o\'zida bitta hududni ko\'rsating.','More from Zinn Digital®'=>'Zinn Digital® haqida qo‘shimcha ma’lumot','Plugins that work with this one, and services from the same team. Cards you hid on other screens can be shown again here.'=>'Ushbu plagin bilan ishlaydigan plaginlar va ayni jamoaning xizmatlari. Boshqa ekranlarda yashirgan kartochkalaringizni bu yerda yana ko\'rsatish mumkin.','Connect for faster help'=>'Tezroq yordam olish uchun ulang','Connecting is optional. It lets you send requests without typing your e-mail each time, and you can disconnect whenever you like.'=>'Ulanish ixtiyoriy. Bu har safar elektron pochtangizni kiritmasdan so\'rovlar yuborish imkonini beradi va xohlagan vaqtda uzib qo\'yishingiz mumkin.','Ask for help or report a bug'=>'Yordam so\'rash yoki xato haqida xabar berish','Describe what happened. You choose whether to attach site information, and you can see exactly what it contains first.'=>'Nima sodir bo\'lganini tasvirlang. Sayt ma\'lumotlarini qo\'shish yoki qo\'shmaslikni o\'zingiz tanlaysiz va avval uning ichida nima borligini aniq ko\'rishingiz mumkin.','Temporary support access'=>'Vaqtinchalik qo‘llab-quvvatlash huquqi','If support needs to look inside your site, create a temporary login here. It deletes itself when it expires, and you can remove it at any time.'=>'Agar qo‘llab-quvvatlash xizmati saytingiz ichini ko‘rishi kerak bo‘lsa, bu yerda vaqtinchalik kirish ma’lumotlarini yarating. U muddati tugagach o‘chib ketadi va uni istalgan vaqtda o‘chirib tashlashingiz mumkin.','Tell us what to build'=>'Nimani qurishimiz kerakligini ayting','Send an idea, a feature request or any feedback. It goes straight to the team.'=>'G‘oya, funksiya so‘rovi yoki har qanday fikr-mulohazani yuboring. U to‘g‘ridan-to‘g‘ri jamoaga borib tushadi.','This takes a few minutes and sets up %s so it works on this site straight away. You can change everything later.'=>'Bu bir necha daqiqa vaqt oladi va %s ni ushbu saytda darhol ishlaydigan qilib sozlaydi. Keyinchalik hamma narsani o\'zgartirishingiz mumkin.','You are ready. If anything does not work as expected, we are one click away.'=>'Siz tayyorsiz. Agar biron narsa kutilgandek ishlamasa, biz birgina tugma bosish masofasidamiz.','Step %1$d of %2$d: %3$s'=>'%1$d-qadam (%2$d tadan): %3$s','Finish'=>'Tugallash','Skip setup'=>'O‘rnatishni o‘tkazib yuborish','Built by Neil Lock, CEO of Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Zinn Digital® Ltd kompaniyasi bosh direktori Neil Lock tomonidan yaratilgan','Version %s'=>'Versiya %s','Tranzly website'=>'Tranzly veb-sayti','Zinn Digital® website'=>'Zinn Digital® veb-sayti','Settings saved.'=>'Sozlamalar saqlandi.','See the Pro plans and pricing'=>'Pro rejalar va narxlarni ko\'rish','Languages'=>'Tillar','The first language is the one your content is written in. Visitors switch with the language switcher block.'=>'Birinchi til — kontentingiz yozilgan til. Tashrif buyuruvchilar tilni almashtirish bloki yordamida o‘tishadi.','(default)'=>'(standart)','Find a language'=>'Tilni topish','Type its name in your language or in its own, then choose it. The code and name below fill in by themselves.'=>'Uning nomini o\'z tilingizda yoki o\'zining tilida kiriting, so\'ngra uni tanlang. Quyidagi kod va nom o\'z-o\'zidan to\'ldiriladi.','Locale code'=>'Til kodi','For example fr_FR'=>'Masalan fr_FR','Name (optional)'=>'Ism (ixtiyoriy)','For example Français'=>'Masalan Français','Add language'=>'Til qo\'shish','Front-end output'=>'Old tomon chiqishi','Class name prefix'=>'Klass nomi prefiksi','Every class name the plugin prints on your pages starts with this prefix, so the pages do not reveal which plugin built them. 1 to 8 lowercase letters or digits, starting with a letter.'=>'Plagin sahifalaringizda chop etadigan har bir klass nomi shu prefiks bilan boshlanadi, shunda sahifalar qaysi plagin tomonidan yaratilganini oshkor qilmaydi. Harf bilan boshlanadigan 1 dan 8 gacha bo\'lgan kichik harflar yoki raqamlar.','Beta updates'=>'Beta yangilanishlar','This site receives beta versions as updates.'=>'Bu sayt yangilanish sifatida beta-versiyalarni qabul qiladi.','This site receives stable versions only.'=>'Ushbu sayt faqat barqaror versiyalarni qabul qiladi.','Change this on the Account page'=>'Buni Hisob sahifasida o\'zgartiring','Beta versions are offered to licensed Pro installations that are connected to their account. Once connected, you can join from the Account page.'=>'Beta versiyalar o\'z hisobiga ulangan litsenziyaga ega Pro o\'rnatishlariga taklif etiladi. Ulangandan so\'ng, Hisob sahifasidan qo\'shilishingiz mumkin.','Save settings'=>'Sozlamalarni saqlash','First engine that is set up'=>'Oʻrnatilgan birinchi dvigatel','Key saved. It is stored encrypted and never shown again.'=>'Kalit saqlandi. U shifrlangan holda saqlanadi va boshqa hech qachon ko\'rsatilmaydi.','Engine settings saved.'=>'Dvigatel sozlamalari saqlandi.','Glossary saved.'=>'Glossariy saqlandi.','Your keys'=>'Sizning kalitlaringiz','Tranzly calls the translation services with your own account. Keys are stored encrypted in your database and are only ever sent to the service they belong to. AI model keys are set in the AI settings.'=>'Tranzly tarjima xizmatlarini o\'zingizning hisobingiz orqali chaqiradi. Kalitlar ma\'lumotlar bazangizda shifrlangan holda saqlanadi va faqat o\'zlari tegishli bo\'lgan xizmatga yuboriladi. Sun\'iy intellekt modeli kalitlari sun\'iy intellekt sozlamalarida belgilanadi.','%s API key'=>'%s API kaliti','Saved: %s. Enter a new key to replace it, or save an empty field to remove it.'=>'Saqlandi: %s. Uni almashtirish uchun yangi kalit kiriting yoki uni olib tashlash uchun maydonni bo\'sh qoldirib saqlang.','No key saved.'=>'Hech qanday kalit saqlanmagan.','Azure region (leave empty for a global resource)'=>'Azure mintaqasi (global resurs uchun bo\'sh qoldiring)','Save key'=>'Kalitni saqlash','Check my DeepL usage'=>'DeepL foydalanishimni tekshirish','%1$s of %2$s characters used this billing period.'=>'Joriy toʻlov davrida %2$s ta belgidan %1$s tasi ishlatildi.','Which engine translates'=>'Qaysi dvigatel tarjima qiladi','No engine is set up yet. Save a key above (or set up an AI model) to start translating.'=>'Hali hech qanday dvigatel sozlanmagan. Tarjimani boshlash uchun yuqorida kalitni saqlang (yoki sun\'iy intellekt modelini sozlang).','Default engine'=>'Standart dvigatel','A different engine per language, automatic fallback and monthly spending caps are Tranzly Pro features.'=>'Har bir til uchun alohida tarjima dvigateli, avtomatik zaxira va oylik xarajatlar limiti Tranzly Pro funksiyalaridir.','Engine for %s'=>'%s uchun dvigatel','The default engine'=>'Standart dvigatel','If an engine fails or reaches a limit, try these next, in this order'=>'Agar biron-bir dvigatel ishdan chiqsa yoki limitga yetsa, quyidagilarni shu tartibda sinab ko\'ring','Monthly spending caps'=>'Oylik xarajatlar limiti','When an engine reaches its cap, nothing more is sent to it until next month and the failed-translation report says why. Leave empty for no cap.'=>'Dvigatel o\'z limitiga yetganda, keyingi oyga qadar unga boshqa hech narsa yuborilmaydi va tarjima xatosi hisobotida nima sababdanligi ko\'rsatiladi. Limit qo\'ymaslik uchun bo\'sh qoldiring.','%1$s (spent this month: $%2$s)'=>'%1$s (shu oyda sarflangan: $%2$s)','Save caps'=>'Saqlash hajm chegaralari','Glossary and words never translated'=>'Glossariy va hech qachon tarjima qilinmaydigan so‘zlar','Never translate these words (one per line)'=>'Ushbu soʻzlarni hech qachon tarjima qilmang (har bir qatorda bittadan)','Brand and product names stay exactly as they are, with every engine.'=>'Brend va mahsulot nomlari har bir dvigatel uchun aynan o\'zicha qoladi.','Preferred translations and tone per language are Tranzly Pro features.'=>'Afzal ko\'rilgan tarjimalar va ohang tillar bo\'yicha Tranzly Pro funksiyalari hisoblanadi.','Preferred translations (one per line: term = translation)'=>'Afzal koʻrilgan tarjimalar (har bir qatorda bittadan: atama = tarjima)','Formality'=>'Rasmiylik','Default'=>'Standart','Formal'=>'Rasmiy','Informal'=>'Norasmiy','Style instructions (audience, brand voice)'=>'Uslub ko\'rsatmalari (auditoriya, brend ovozi)','Save glossary'=>'Glossariyni saqlash','Settings'=>'Sozlamalar','Translation engine'=>'Tarjima dvigateli','What Tranzly translates on this site'=>'Tranzly ushbu saytda nimani tarjima qilishi','found, translated with your content'=>'topildi, kontentingiz bilan tarjima qilindi','not on this site'=>'bu saytda emas','With Tranzly Pro: Elementor, Bricks, Divi, Beaver Builder, Oxygen and WPBakery pages; everything in WooCommerce, with prices in the visitor’s currency; the SEO fields of Yoast SEO, Rank Math, SEOPress and All in One SEO; ACF, Meta Box and Pods fields; forms and their e-mails; your theme’s and plugins’ own text; and comments and reviews.'=>'Tranzly Pro yordamida: Elementor, Bricks, Divi, Beaver Builder, Oxygen va WPBakery sahifalari; WooCommerce\'dagi hamma narsa, tashrif buyuruvchining valyutasidagi narxlar bilan; Yoast SEO, Rank Math, SEOPress va All in One SEO\'ning SEO maydonlari; ACF, Meta Box va Pods maydonlari; formalari va ularning elektron xatlari; filmingiz va plaginlaringizning o\'z matni; hamda izoh va sharhlar.','Shop text and e-mails'=>'Do\'kon matni va elektron xatlar','E-mail subjects and headings, payment and shipping method names, and the checkout notices. Each order’s e-mails go out in the language it was placed in.'=>'Elektron pochta mavzulari va sarlavhalari, toʻlov va yetkazib berish usullari nomlari hamda rasmiylashtiruv bildirishnomalari. Har bir buyurtmaning elektron xatlari u qaysi tilda berilgan boʻlsa, oʻsha tilda yuboriladi.','Forms and their e-mails'=>'Formalar va ularning elektron pochta xabarlari','Every form keeps one list of entries; its labels, buttons, messages and e-mails appear in the visitor’s language.'=>'Har bir forma yozuvlar ro‘yxatini saqlaydi; uning yorliqlari, tugmalari, xabarlari va elektron pochta xabarlari tashrif buyuruvchining tilida ko‘rinadi.','Saved.'=>'Saqlandi.','No ACF, Meta Box or Pods fields are defined yet.'=>'Hali hech qanday ACF, Meta Box yoki Pods maydonlari aniqlanmagan.','Field'=>'Maydon','Where'=>'Qayerda','In a translation'=>'Tarjimada','What happens to %s in a translation'=>'Tarjimada %s bilan nima sodir bo\'ladi','Translate it'=>'Tarjima qilish','Copy it as it is'=>'Uni qanday bo\'lsa, shunday nusxa ko\'chiring','Leave it empty'=>'Bo\'sh qoldiring','The shop’s currency'=>'Doʻkon valyutasi','Currencies'=>'Valyutalar','Show prices in other currencies (the shop’s own is %s)'=>'Boshqa valyutalardagi narxlarni ko\'rsatish (do\'konning o\'niki: %s)','Exchange rates'=>'Valyuta kurslari','Rates last updated %s.'=>'Tariflar oxirgi marta %s da yangilandi.','Rates have not been fetched yet.'=>'Tariflar hali olinmagan.','Update the rates now'=>'Tarifларни hozir yangilash','New currency'=>'Yangi valyuta','Choose…'=>'Tanlang...','Rate (per 1 %s)'=>'Kurs (1 %s uchun)','Typing a rate keeps it: the daily update will not change it.'=>'Stavka kiritish uni saqlab qoladi: kundalik yangilanish uni o\'zgartirmaydi.','Rounding'=>'Yaxlitlash','None'=>'Yo\'q','Round up'=>'O‘nlab yaxlitlash','Round to the nearest'=>'Eng yaqiniga yaxlitlash','Round down'=>'Pastga yaxlitlash','Round to (for example 1, 0.05 or 10)'=>'Yaxlitlash (masalan, 1, 0.05 yoki 10)','Prices end in (for example 0.99)'=>'Narxlar quyidagi raqam bilan tugaydi (masalan, 0.99)','Add a currency'=>'Valyuta qo\'shish','Which visitors see which currency'=>'Qaysi tashrif buyuruvchilar qaysi valyutani ko\'radi','By country: two-letter country code (for example CH)'=>'Mamlakat boʻyicha: ikki harfli mamlakat kodi (masalan, CH)','Visitors from %s'=>'%s dan tashrif buyuruvchilar','Let visitors choose (shortcode [tranzly_currency_switcher])'=>'Tashrif buyuruvchilarga tanlash imkonini berish (shortcode [tranzly_currency_switcher])','Prices now depend on a cookie or on the visitor’s country: make sure your page cache varies by the "tranzly_currency" cookie, or excludes shop pages.'=>'Narxlar endi kukiga yoki tashrif buyuruvchining mamlakatiga bog\'liq: sahifa keshingiz "tranzly_currency" kukisi bo\'yicha o\'zgarishiga yoki do\'kon sahifalarini istisno qilishiga e\'tibor bering.','Save currencies'=>'Valyutalarni saqlash','The words your theme and plugins print themselves (buttons, labels). Read a theme or plugin once, then translate its text here; your translation wins over the plugin’s own.'=>'Mavzu va plaginlaringiz o\'zi chiqaradigan so\'zlar (tugmalar, yorliqlar). Mavzu yoki plaginni bir marta o\'qing, so\'ngra uning matnini shu yerda tarjima qiling; sizning tarjimangiz plaginning o\'zinikidan ustun keladi.','%d texts'=>'%d ta matn','not read yet'=>'oʻqilmagan','Read again'=>'Qayta oʻqish','Read its text'=>'Matnini o‘qish','Job started with %d translations to do. It runs in the background: you can close this page.'=>'Bajarilishi kerak bo\'lgan %d ta tarjima bilan vazifa boshlandi. U fonda ishlaydi: bu sahifani yopishingiz mumkin.','Queued again.'=>'Qaytadan navbatga qoʻshildi.','Running'=>'Ishlamoqda','Finished'=>'Yakunlandi','Set up a translation engine in the Engines tab first.'=>'Avval "Dvigatel" yorlig\'ida tarjima dvigatelini sozlang.','Translate every'=>'Har birini tarjima qilish','Into'=>'Ichiga','With'=>'Bilan','Each language’s own engine'=>'Har bir tilning oʻziga xos mexanizmi','Publish the translations (otherwise they are saved as drafts)'=>'Tarjikalarni chop eting (aks holda ular qoralama sifatida saqlanadi)','Estimate the cost'=>'Narxni hisoblash','%1$d posts, %2$s characters. The price for this engine is not known in advance.'=>'%1$d ta post, %2$s ta belgi. Bu dvigatelning narxi oldindan ma\'lum emas.','%1$d posts, %2$s characters: about $%3$s on your own account.'=>'%1$d ta post, %2$s ta belgi: o\'z hisobingizda taxminan $%3$s.','Start translating'=>'Tarjimani boshlash','Jobs'=>'Vazifalar','No translation jobs yet.'=>'Hozircha tarjima vazifalari yo‘q.','Job %1$d — %2$s'=>'Vazifa %1$d — %2$s','%1$d of %2$d translated, %3$d failed, %4$d skipped (protected or already in that language)'=>'%1$d / %2$d tarjima qilindi, %3$d tasi bajarilmadi, %4$d tasi oʻtkazib yuborildi (himoyalangan yoki allaqachon shu tilda mavjud)','Stop this job'=>'Ushbu vazifani to\'xtatish','See what failed and why'=>'Nima muvaffaqiyatsiz bo\'lganini va nima uchunligini ko\'ring','Content'=>'Kontent','Language'=>'Til','What went wrong'=>'Nima xato ketdi','Fix it'=>'Tuzatish','Retry with'=>'Qaytadan urinish:','The same engine'=>'Xuddi shu dvigatel','Retry'=>'Qaytadan urinish','Translate by hand'=>'Qo\'lda tarjima qilish','Menus saved.'=>'Menular saqlandi.','%d texts translated.'=>'%d ta matn tarjima qilindi.','Saved. Your corrections are protected from machine translation.'=>'Saqlandi. Tuzatishlaringiz mashina tarjimasidan himoyalangan.','The same menu, translated'=>'Bir xil menyu, tarjima qilingan','A separate menu per language'=>'Har bir til uchun alohida menyu','By default each menu is translated: its links lead to the translated pages, with their titles. Choose a menu of its own for a language here instead.'=>'Odatiy bo‘yicha har bir menyu tarjima qilinadi: uning havolalari o‘z sarlavhalari bilan tarjima qilingan sahifalarga olib boradi. Buning o‘rniga bu yerda har bir til uchun alohida menyuni tanlang.','Shared text'=>'Umumiy matn','Which text'=>'Qaysi matn','Menu labels'=>'Menyu yorliqlari','Site title, tagline and widgets'=>'Sayt sarlavhasi, shiori va vidjetlari','Templates, headers, footers and patterns'=>'Shablonlar, sarlavhalar, quyi qism va namunalar','Translate the missing text'=>'Yetishmayotgan matnni tarjima qilish','There is no text to translate here.'=>'Bu yerda tarjima qilish uchun matn yo\'q.','Corrected by a person, protected'=>'Odam tomonidan tuzatilgan, himoyalangan','Save corrections'=>'O‘zgarishlarni saqlash','Languages and settings'=>'Tillar va sozlamalar','Engines'=>'Dvigatellar','Translation jobs'=>'Tarjima vazifalari','Addresses and SEO'=>'Manzil va SEO','Language switchers'=>'Tilni o\'zgartirgichlar','SEO audit'=>'SEO audit','Menus and shared text'=>'Menyular va umumiy matn','Integrations'=>'Integratsiyalar','No meta description'=>'Meta-tavsif yo‘q','A language version visitors cannot open (draft, private or password)'=>'Tashrif buyuruvchilar ochib bo\'lmaydigan til versiyasi (qoralama, shaxsiy yoki parol bilan himoyalangan)','The address still uses the original words'=>'Manzil hali ham asl so‘zlardan foydalanmoqda','Still holds the original text'=>'Asl matnni saqlab qoladi','The multilingual SEO audit is part of Tranzly Pro. It finds missing meta descriptions, broken hreflang, untranslated addresses and duplicate content, per language.'=>'Ko‘p tilli SEO audit Tranzly Pro tarkibiga kiradi. U har bir til bo‘yicha yetishmayotgan meta tavsiflarini, buzilgan hreflang’larni, tarjima qilinmagan manzillarni va takroriy kontentni aniqlaydi.','Language to audit'=>'Tekshiriladigan til','Run the audit'=>'Auditni bajarish','Check the next pages'=>'Keyingi sahifalarni tekshiring','%1$d pages checked, %2$d problems found.'=>'%1$d ta sahifa tekshirildi, %2$d ta muammo topildi.','The whole language has been checked.'=>'Butun til tekshirib chiqildi.','Page'=>'Sahifa','Problem'=>'Muammo','Job %1$d started: %2$d pages are being translated in the background. Follow it in Translation jobs.'=>'%1$d-vazifa boshlandi: %2$d ta sahifa fonda tarjima qilinmoqda. Uni “Tarjima vazifalari” bo‘limida kuzating.','%d translations are being checked in the background. Scores appear here as they arrive.'=>'%d ta tarjima fonda tekshirilmoqda. Ballar kelib tushishi bilan shu yerda ko\'rinadi.','Missing'=>'Topilmadi','Out of date'=>'Eskiroq','Translated'=>'Tarjima qilingan','Edited by a person'=>'Boshqa shaxs tomonidan tahrirlangan','Machine translated'=>'Avtomatik tarjima qilingan','Waiting for review'=>'Ko‘rib chiqish kutilmoqda','Needs a human look'=>'Inson nazorati kerak','Everything'=>'Hammasi','Up to date'=>'Yangilangan','Tranzly is still working out which older translations are out of date. The "out of date" numbers will grow while it does.'=>'Tranzly qaysi eski tarjimalar eskirganligini aniqlash ustida hali ham ishlamoqda. Shu jarayonda "eskirgan" raqamlar o\'sib boradi.','Content type'=>'Kontent turi','All content'=>'Barcha tarkib','Average quality'=>'O‘rtacha sifat','%1$d translated (%2$d%%)'=>'%1$d tarjima qilindi (%2$d%%)','Show'=>'Ko\'rsatish','Translate everything missing'=>'Barcha yetishmayotgan qismlarni tarjima qilish','Update everything out of date'=>'Barcha eskirgan narsalarni yangilash','Check the quality with AI'=>'Sun\'iy intellekt yordamida sifatni tekshirish','Translate the low-scoring pages again'=>'Past bali olgan sahifalarni qaytadan tarjima qiling','Nothing here.'=>'Bu yerda hech narsa yo\'q.','Quality'=>'Sifat','by a person'=>'shaxs tomonidan','waiting for review'=>'ko\'rib chiqish kutilmoqda','Show more'=>'Ko\'proq ko\'rsatish','Bulk translate the whole site (Pro)'=>'Butun saytni ommaviy tarjima qilish (Pro)','With Tranzly Pro, choose content types and languages, see the estimate, and translate the whole site in one go.'=>'Tranzly Pro yordamida kontent turlari va tillarni tanlang, taxminiy qiymatni ko\'ring va butun saytni bir yo\'la tarjima qiling.','%d background jobs started, one per language. Follow them in Translation jobs.'=>'%d ta fon jarayoni boshlandi, har bir til uchun bittadan. Ularni Tarjima vazifalaridan kuzatib boring.','Content types'=>'Kontent turlari','What to translate'=>'Nimani tarjima qilish kerak','Only what is missing'=>'Faqat yetishmayotgani','Only what is out of date'=>'Faqat eskirgan narsalar','Everything (pages edited by a person stay as they are)'=>'Barchasi (odam tomonidan tahrirlangan sahifalar o\'zicha qoladi)','Estimate'=>'Baholash','%1$d pages, %2$s characters. This engine does not publish a price.'=>'%1$d sahifa, %2$s belgi. Bu dvigatel narx e\'lon qilmaydi.','%1$d pages, %2$s characters, about $%3$s.'=>'%1$d sahifa, %2$s belgi, taxminan $%3$s.','Find a text'=>'Matnni topish','%d more: type in "Find a text" to narrow the list.'=>'Yana %d ta: roʻyxatni qisqartirish uchun "Matnni topish" deb yozing.','A small button in a corner of every page, on any theme, with no set-up.'=>'Har qanday mavzuda, sozlashlarsiz, har bir sahinaning burchagida kichik tugma.','Off'=>'O‘chiq','Bottom corner, end side'=>'Pastki burchak, oxirgi tomon','Bottom corner, start side'=>'Pastqi burchak, boshlanish tomoni','Top corner, end side'=>'Yuqori burchak, oxirgi tomon','Top corner, start side'=>'Yuqori burchak, boshlanish tomoni','Switcher around the content'=>'Kontent atrofidagi o\'tkazgich','Add a switcher to every post and page'=>'Har bir post va sahifaga almashtirgich qo\'shish','Before the content'=>'Kontentdan oldin','After the content'=>'Kontentdan keyin','Other ways to add a switcher'=>'Boshqa almashtirgich qo\'shish usullari','Block editor and site editor: the “Language switcher” block, with five designs.'=>'Blok muharriri va sayt muharriri: beshta dizaynga ega "Tilni almashtirgich" bloki.','Page Builder Sandwich: the “Language switcher” element.'=>'Page Builder Sandwich: “Language switcher” elementi.','Menus: Appearance → Menus → “Language switcher” box.'=>'Menyular: Tashqi ko‘rinish → Menyular → “Tilni o‘zgartirgich” katakchasi.','Sidebars: the “Language switcher” widget.'=>'Yon panellar: “Tilni almashtirgich” vidjeti.','Anywhere else, the shortcode:'=>'Boshqa istalgan joyda, qisqa kod:','Elementor and Bricks: the “Language switcher” widget in each builder.'=>'Elementor va Bricks: har bir konstruktordagi “Tilni almashtirgich” vidjeti.','Elementor and Bricks widgets are part of Tranzly Pro.'=>'Elementor va Bricks vidjetlari Tranzly Pro tarkibiga kiradi.','Save'=>'Saqlash','A folder per language: example.com/de/'=>'Har bir til uchun bitta papka: example.com/de/','A subdomain per language: de.example.com'=>'Har bir til uchun bitta kichik domen: de.example.com','A separate domain per language: example.de'=>'Har bir til uchun alohida domen: example.de','A query parameter: example.com/?lang=de (older sites)'=>'So\'rov parametri: example.com/?lang=de (eski saytlar)','Category'=>'Kategoriya','Tag'=>'Teg','Product'=>'Mahsulot','Product category'=>'Mahsulot toifasi','Product tag'=>'Mahsulot tegi','Saved. Your language addresses have changed as shown below.'=>'Saqlandi. Til manzillaringiz quyida ko\'rsatilganidek o\'zgartirildi.','Language in the address'=>'Manzildagi til','How visitors and search engines reach each language'=>'Tashrif buyuruvchilar va qidiruv tizimlari har bir tilga qanday erishishi','Address word for %s'=>'%s uchun manzil so\'zi','The default language has no word in its addresses.'=>'Standart tilda manzillarida hech qanday so‘z yo‘q.','Domain for %s (optional)'=>'%s uchun domen (ixtiyoriy)','Point the domain at this site first. A language with no domain uses a folder on your main domain.'=>'Avval domenni ushbu saytga yo\'naltiring. Domensiz til asosiy domeningizdagi papkadan foydalanadi.','Where each language lives now'=>'Har bir til hozir qayerda yashaydi','Translated address words'=>'Tarjima qilingan manzil so\'zlari','Page and post addresses come from their translated titles. Here you translate the fixed words, so /de/kategorie/ replaces /de/category/.'=>'Sahifa va post manzillari ularning tarjima qilingan savarlaridan kelib chiqadi. Bu yerda siz o\'zgarmas so\'zlarni tarjima qilasiz, shuning uchun /de/category/ o\'rniga /de/kategorie/ ishlatiladi.','%1$s (now “%2$s”)'=>'%1$s (hozirda “%2$s”)','Search engines and visitors'=>'Qidiruv tizimlari va tashrif buyuruvchilar','Offer visitors their own language with a small banner (never a redirect)'=>'Tashrif buyuruvchilarga kichik banner yordamida oʻz tillarini taklif qiling (hech qachon yoʻnaltirish emas)','Hide untranslated pages from search engines (noindex)'=>'Qidiruv tizimlaridan tarjima qilinmagan sahifalarni yashirish (noindex)','A translation that still holds the original text is kept out of search results until it is translated.'=>'Asl matnni o\'z ichida saqlab turgan tarjima tarjima qilinmaguncha qidiruv natijalaridan chiqarib tashlanadi.','Part of Tranzly Pro.'=>'Tranzly Pro\'ning bir qismi.','Tranzly adds hreflang links (with x-default), the page language and direction, and every language to your sitemap:'=>'Tranzly hreflang havolalarini (x-default bilan), sahifa tili va yo‘nalishini hamda har bir tilni sayt xaritangizga qo‘shadi:','Working together with: %s.'=>'Birgalikda ishlayotgan hamkor: %s.','Each address word is 2 to 12 lowercase letters, digits or hyphens.'=>'Har bir manzil soʻzi 2 tadan 12 tagacha kichik harflar, raqamlar yoki defislardan iborat boʻlishi kerak.','Auto-translate on update, reviewer roles, XLIFF export for translators, switching from WPML, Polylang or TranslatePress and the AI quality check come with Tranzly Pro.'=>'Yangilanishda avtomatik tarjima qilish, muharrir rollari, tarjimonlar uchun XLIFF eksporti, WPML, Polylang yoki TranslatePress\'dan o\'tish va sun\'iy intellekt yordamida sifatni tekshirish Tranzly Pro bilan birga keladi.','When an original changes'=>'Asl nusxa o\'zgarganda','When a page is edited'=>'Sahifa tahrirlanganda','Mark its translations out of date'=>'Ushbu tarjimalarni eskirgan deb belgilash','Translate its translations again in the background'=>'Uni fon rejimida qayta tarjima qilish','Do nothing'=>'Hech narsa qilmang','A translation a person edited is never overwritten; it is marked out of date instead.'=>'Odam tahrir qilgan tarjima hech qachon ustidan yozib yuborilmaydi; uning o\'rniga eskirgan deb belgilanadi.','Translate new pages into every language when they are published'=>'Yangi sahifalar e\'lon qilinganda ularni har bir tilga tarjima qiling','A second AI model reads each translation beside its original, scores it and names the mistakes. It uses your own AI key from the AI settings. Start a check from Translation status.'=>'Ikkinchi sun\'iy intellekt modeli har bir tarjimani asl nusxasi yonidan o\'qiydi, unga ball qo\'yadi va xatolarni ko\'rsatadi. U sun\'iy intellekt sozlamalaridagi o\'zingizning sun\'iy intellekt kalitingizdan foydalanadi. Tarjima holatidan tekshiruvni boshlang.','AI provider'=>'Sun\'iy intellekt provayderi','The AI settings’ general model'=>'AI sozlamalarining umumiy modeli','Recommended'=>'Tavsiya etilgan','A page needs a human look below this score'=>'Ushbu baldan pastdagi sahifa inson ko\'zidan o\'tishi kerak','Publish only translations a reviewer approved'=>'Faqat taqrizchi tasdiqlagan tarjimalarni chop eting','Give people the Translator role (edits translations, never the originals, cannot publish) or the Translation reviewer role (also approves). Reviewers also find everything waiting in the Posts and Pages lists under “Pending”; publishing one there approves it.'=>'Odamlarga Tarjimon rolini (faqat tarjimasini tahrirlaydi, asl nusxaga teginmaydi, chop eta olmaydi) yoki Tarjima taqrizchisi rolini (tasdiqlash huquqi ham bor) bering. Shuningdek, taqrizchilar "Kutilmoqda" ostidagi "Yozuvlar" va "Sahifalar" roʻyxatlarida kutilayotgan barcha narsalarni topadilar; u yerda bittasini chop etish uni tasdiqlaydi.','Manage users'=>'Foydalanuvchilarni boshqarish','Nothing is waiting for review.'=>'Ko‘rib chiqish uchun hech narsa yo‘q.','Note for the translator (optional)'=>'Tarjimon uchun eslatma (ixtiyoriy)','Read side by side'=>'Yonma-yon o‘qish','Approve'=>'Tasdiqlash','Ask for changes'=>'O\'zgarishlarni so\'rash','%d translations imported and protected from machine translation.'=>'%d ta tarjima import qilindi va mashina tarjimasidan himoya qilindi.','Export and import for translators'=>'Tarjimonlar uchun eksport va import','Not translated yet'=>'Hali tarjima qilinmagan','Already translated'=>'Allaqachon tarjima qilingan','Format'=>'Format','XLIFF 1.2 (translation tools)'=>'XLIFF 1.2 (tarjima vositalari)','CSV (spreadsheets)'=>'CSV (jadval)','Download the file'=>'Faylni yuklab olish','Import a translated file'=>'Tarjima qilingan faylni import qilish','Undone: %1$d links removed, %2$d imported pages deleted.'=>'Bajarilmadi: %1$d ta havola olib tashlandi, %2$d ta import qilingan sahifa o‘chirildi.','Dry run, nothing changed:'=>'Sinov rejimi, hech narsa o‘zgartirilmadi:','Imported:'=>'Import qilindi:','%1$d languages added, %2$d translations linked, %3$d pages built, %4$d texts.'=>'%1$d ta til qo\'shildi, %2$d ta tarjima bog\'landi, %3$d ta sahifa yaratildi, %4$d ta matn.','Switch the other plugin off first (its addresses and switchers would fight Tranzly). Its data stays where it is, so you can switch back; Undo removes exactly what the import added.'=>'Avval boshqa plaginni o\'chiring (uning manzillari va o\'chirib-yoqgichlari Tranzly bilan ziddiyatga keladi). Uning ma\'lumotlari o\'z joyida qoladi, shuning uchun siz qaytadan yoqishingiz mumkin; Bekor qilish faqat import qo\'shgan narsani olib tashlaydi.','No data from this plugin on this site.'=>'Bu saytda ushbu pligindan maʼlumot yoʻq.','Languages: %s'=>'Tillar: %s','still active: switch it off first.'=>'hali ham faol: oldin uni o\'chiring.','Dry run'=>'Sinov tariqasida bajarish','Import'=>'Import qilish','Undo the import'=>'Importni bekor qilish','Comments and product reviews'=>'Sharhlar va mahsulot sharhlari','Each language keeps its own'=>'Har bir til o\'ziga xos saqlaydi','Show every language’s comments on every version'=>'Har bir versiya bo\'yicha barcha tillardagi izohlarni ko\'rsatish','Show them all, translated into the reader’s language'=>'Ularning barchasini o\'quvchi tiliga tarjima qilgan holda ko\'rsatish','Translating uses your translation engine for every approved comment. Spam and comments waiting for moderation are never sent.'=>'Tarjima qilish tasdiqlangan har bir izoh uchun sizning tarjima mexanizmingizdan foydalanadi. Spam va moderatsiyani kutayotgan izohlar hech qachon yuborilmaydi.','Saved. The pieces you changed are marked as checked by a person, and this translation is protected from machine translation.'=>'Saqlandi. O\'zgartirgan qismlaringiz shaxs tomonidan tekshirilgan deb belgilandi va bu tarjima mashina tarjimasidan himoyalandi.','The layout of this translation was changed in the editor, so some pieces no longer pair with the original. Pieces without a partner are shown empty; edit the rest in the editor.'=>'Ushbu tarjimaning tartibi muharrirda o\'zgartirildi, shuning uchun ba\'zi qismlar endi asl nusxaga mos kelmaydi. Juftsiz qismlar bo\'sh ko\'rsatilgan; qolganlarini muharrirda tahrirlang.','Open the editor'=>'Muharrirni ochish','Original (%s)'=>'Asl nusxa (%s)','Translation (%s)'=>'Tarjima (%s)','Save changes'=>'O\'zgarishlarni saqlash','Open in the editor'=>'Muharrirda ochish','Checked by a person'=>'Odam tomonidan tekshirilgan','Imported'=>'Import qilindi','Not in the translation'=>'Tarjimada yoʻq','Add a second language under Tranzly in the admin menu, and the switcher appears here.'=>'Boshqaruv menyusida Tranzly ostida ikkinchi tilni qo\'shing va o\'tkazgich shu yerda paydo bo\'ladi.','Off by default: a flag is a country, not a language.'=>'Standart bo\'yicha o\'chirilgan: bayroq bu til emas, balki mamlakat.','What screen readers announce, for example “Choose a language”.'=>'Ekran o\'quvchilari nima e\'lon qilishi, masalan, "Tilni tanlang".','Colours'=>'Rangлар','Not translated'=>'Tarjima qilinmagan','Original'=>'Asl nusxa','Published'=>'Nashr qilingan','Draft'=>'Qoralama','Checked by a person, protected'=>'Odam tomonidan tekshirilgan, himoyalangan','Imported, protected'=>'Import qilingan, himoyalangan','Not translated yet (a copy)'=>'Hali tarjima qilinmagan (nusxasi)','View'=>'Ko‘rish','Unlock so it can be translated again'=>'Qaytadan tarjima qilinishi uchun qulfdan chiqaring','Protect'=>'Himoyalash','Publish the translations'=>'Tarjimalarni nashr qilish','Translate into %d language'=>'%d ta tilga tarjima qilish' . "\0" . '%d ta tilga tarjima qilish','Show this block'=>'Ushbu blokni ko\'rsatish','In every language'=>'Har bir tilda','Only in the languages ticked'=>'Faqat belgilangan tillarda','In every language except those ticked'=>'Belgilanganlardan tashqari har bir tilda','AI agents are allowed. Reload this page to see the tools.'=>'AI agentlarga ruxsat berilgan. Vositalarni ko‘rish uchun ushbu sahifani yangilang.','AI agents are turned off. Their connection address no longer answers.'=>'AI agentlari oʻchirilgan. Ularning ulanish manzili endi javob bermayapti.','Image per language'=>'Har bir til uchun rasm','Show another image to readers of a language, for example a banner with words on it.'=>'O‘quvchilarga boshqa tilda boshqa rasmni, masalan, ustida yozuvi bor bannerni ko‘rsatish.','Replace the %s image'=>'%s rasmini almashtirish','Choose a %s image'=>'%s tasvirini tanlang','Use the original image'=>'Asl rasmdan foydalanish','Correct this translation'=>'Tarjimani to\'g\'rilang','Saving…'=>'Saqlanmoqda...','Translated text. Press Enter to correct it.'=>'Tarjima qilingan matn. Uni to‘g‘rilash uchun Enter tugmasini bosing.','Click any outlined text to correct its translation.'=>'Tarjimasini tuzatish uchun istalgan belgilangan matnni bosing.','No translated text was found on this page to edit here. Use the side-by-side editor instead.'=>'Bu sahifada tahrirlash uchun tarjima qilingan matn topilmadi. Buning o\'rniga yonma-yon muharrirdan foydalaning.','block titleLanguage switcher'=>'Tilni o\'zgartirgich','block descriptionLinks to this page in each of the site\'s languages. It renders nothing until two or more languages are listed.'=>'Saytning har bir tilidagi ushbu sahifaga havolalar. Ikki yoki undan ortiq tillar ko\'rsatilmaguncha u hech narsa ko\'rsatmaydi.','block keywordlanguage'=>'Til','block keywordswitcher'=>'almashtirgich','block keywordtranslation'=>'tarjima','block descriptionLets visitors read this page in another of your languages: a list, pills, buttons, a dropdown or language codes, with optional flags.'=>'Tashrif buyuruvchilarga bu sahifani boshqa tilingizda o‘qish imkonini beradi: ro‘yxat, tugmalar, ochiladigan menyu yoki til kodlari, ixtiyoriy ravishda bayroqlar bilan.','block keywordmultilingual'=>'ko\'p tilli']];